('27de3b14-4d0c-5502-be3d-8ae45d459325','a84451cc-25ee-5a9c-bee9-79807e22404d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a liquid that you put on a surface , using a brush to make the surface a particular colour',null,null,'رنگ، رنگ‌آمیزی (مایع)؛ رنگ (چهره)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a can/tin/pot of paint He had spilt a can of paint on the floor.','a tube of paint There was a painting on one of the easels and a table with his brushes and tubes of paint.','a layer of paint They removed the old layers of paint.','a coat of paint (= a layer of paint that is put on something ) Walls usually need at least two coats of paint.','a lick of paint informal (= a layer of paint used to make something more attractive ) All she needed to do to the kitchen was give it a lick of paint.','white/red/blue etc I decided to use white paint throughout the house.','wet Careful – the paint is still wet.','dry Remove the tape when the paint is dry.','fresh (= new – used especially about the smell of new paint ) The place smelled of fresh paint and new carpets.','peeling/flaking paint (= starting to come off a surface because it is old ) She lived in a gloomy old building with peeling paint on the walls.','put paint on something Don’t put the paint on too thick.','apply paint formal Clean the surface before applying the paint with a brush or roller.','spray paint (= send paint out from a container in a stream of very small drops ) Vandals had sprayed paint all over the walls.','strip paint (= remove all the paint from a surface ) We decided to strip the paint off the doors.','scrape off/away paint (= take most of the paint off a surface using a tool ) Scrape off any loose or flaking paint and rub the surface with sandpaper.','paint dries Wait for the paint to dry.','paint peels/flakes The paint was starting to peel off the window frame.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a can of blue paint","translation":"یک قوطی رنگ آبی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000390931.mp3"},{"sentence":"Wet paint (= used as a warning on signs when something has just been painted )","translation":"رنگ مرطوب (= هنگامی که چیزی تازه رنگ شده است به عنوان هشدار در علائم استفاده می شود)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761164.mp3"},{"sentence":"The whole house could do with a fresh coat of paint .","translation":"کل خانه می تواند با یک لایه رنگ تازه کار کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000390935.mp3"},{"sentence":"All this room needs is a lick of paint (= paint used to make a place more attractive ) .","translation":"تنها چیزی که این اتاق نیاز دارد یک لیس رنگ است (= رنگی که برای جذاب‌تر کردن مکان استفاده می‌شود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761168.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('48aa5fee-4284-52d8-9d56-555e0178f18d','a84451cc-25ee-5a9c-bee9-79807e22404d',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'paints','رنگ، رنگ‌آمیزی (مایع)؛ رنگ (چهره)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a can/tin/pot of paint He had spilt a can of paint on the floor.','a tube of paint There was a painting on one of the easels and a table with his brushes and tubes of paint.','a layer of paint They removed the old layers of paint.','a coat of paint (= a layer of paint that is put on something ) Walls usually need at least two coats of paint.','a lick of paint informal (= a layer of paint used to make something more attractive ) All she needed to do to the kitchen was give it a lick of paint.','white/red/blue etc I decided to use white paint throughout the house.','wet Careful – the paint is still wet.','dry Remove the tape when the paint is dry.','fresh (= new – used especially about the smell of new paint ) The place smelled of fresh paint and new carpets.','peeling/flaking paint (= starting to come off a surface because it is old ) She lived in a gloomy old building with peeling paint on the walls.','put paint on something Don’t put the paint on too thick.','apply paint formal Clean the surface before applying the paint with a brush or roller.','spray paint (= send paint out from a container in a stream of very small drops ) Vandals had sprayed paint all over the walls.','strip paint (= remove all the paint from a surface ) We decided to strip the paint off the doors.','scrape off/away paint (= take most of the paint off a surface using a tool ) Scrape off any loose or flaking paint and rub the surface with sandpaper.','paint dries Wait for the paint to dry.','paint peels/flakes The paint was starting to peel off the window frame.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('4a80f074-9c42-538f-98f8-d536ed56f368','33772cdd-e03a-56f1-ba48-8d0dbb1d44e1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to put paint on a surface','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'رنگ کردن، نقاشی کردن؛ تصویر ساختن (کلمات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The ceiling needs painting.","translation":"سقف نیاز به رنگ آمیزی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000390965.mp3"},{"sentence":"brightly painted houses","translation":"خانه هایی با رنگ های درخشان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001536969.mp3"},{"sentence":"We painted the door blue.","translation":"در را آبی کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000390968.mp3"},{"sentence":"Paint the walls in a contrasting colour.","translation":"دیوارها را با رنگ متضاد رنگ آمیزی کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001536974.mp3"},{"sentence":"The living room was painted in pastel shades of pink and blue.","translation":"اتاق نشیمن با سایه های پاستلی صورتی و آبی رنگ آمیزی شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001536975.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('0d45fc85-5af6-5a9f-8c1e-b328f5e2a73f','33772cdd-e03a-56f1-ba48-8d0dbb1d44e1',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to make a picture , design etc using paint','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'برای ساختن یک تصویر، طراحی و غیره با استفاده از رنگ','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A white cross was painted on the door.","translation":"یک صلیب سفید روی در نقاشی شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001536981.mp3"},{"sentence":"Turner is famous for painting landscapes.","translation":"ترنر به خاطر نقاشی مناظر مشهور است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001536980.mp3"},{"sentence":"He paints mainly in acrylics.","translation":"او عمدتاً با اکرلیک نقاشی می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001536984.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('61c126eb-8854-55b1-9a5f-6dfe346593cd','33772cdd-e03a-56f1-ba48-8d0dbb1d44e1',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to put a coloured substance on part of your face or body to make it different or more attractive','[ transitive ]',null,'یک ماده رنگی روی قسمتی از صورت یا بدن خود قرار دهید تا آن را متفاوت یا جذاب تر کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The children’s faces were painted to look like animals.","translation":"صورت بچه ها طوری نقاشی شده بود که شبیه حیوانات باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001536985.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’d painted her toenails with red nail polish.","translation":"او ناخن های پایش را با لاک قرمز رنگ کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000390996.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('273bb502-a9ab-5434-ae57-e6a39963e677','33772cdd-e03a-56f1-ba48-8d0dbb1d44e1',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to describe someone or something in a particular way','[ transitive ]',null,'برای توصیف کسی یا چیزی به شیوه ای خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s often been painted as a tough businesswoman.","translation":"او اغلب به عنوان یک تاجر سرسخت ترسیم شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761180.mp3"},{"sentence":"Dickens painted a grim picture of Victorian life.","translation":"دیکنز تصویری تلخ از زندگی ویکتوریا ترسیم کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001536987.mp3"},{"sentence":"The article painted him in a bad light (= described him in a way that made him seem bad ) .","translation":"مقاله او را بد رنگ کرد ( = او را به گونه ای توصیف کرد که او را بد جلوه داد ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761181.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('6ee96186-a536-5ffb-9d6a-65dd8ae0da26','33772cdd-e03a-56f1-ba48-8d0dbb1d44e1',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'paint the town (red)','رنگ کردن، نقاشی کردن؛ تصویر ساختن (کلمات)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('694d2fd7-b4c7-5088-a99f-988a1edb8d90','56ac7faf-b261-5a7c-ac6d-8ec5fe5eddf8',1,'group of people','گروهی از مردم','spoken & written','a group of people with skills or specialist knowledge who have been chosen to give advice or opinions on a particular subject',null,null,'هیئت، گروه (کارشناسان)؛ تابلوی برق؛ پنل (درب)',array['jury']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A panel of experts has looked at the proposal.","translation":"گروهی از کارشناسان این پیشنهاد را بررسی کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000362407.mp3"},{"sentence":"There will be at least three senior doctors on the panel.","translation":"حداقل سه پزشک ارشد در پانل حضور خواهند داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001722201.mp3"},{"sentence":"We have two senior politicians on our panel tonight.","translation":"ما امشب دو سیاستمدار ارشد را در پنل خود داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001722204.mp3"},{"sentence":"The panel spent 14 hours going over the evidence.","translation":"هیئت 14 ساعت صرف بررسی شواهد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001722206.mp3"},{"sentence":"The panel has reached a decision.","translation":"هیئت به تصمیمی رسیده است.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"The panel have reached a decision.","translation":"هیئت به تصمیمی رسیده است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,6),
('6f9dbd96-0987-5003-a70f-ef9a23772c27','56ac7faf-b261-5a7c-ac6d-8ec5fe5eddf8',2,'piece of something','تکه ای از چیزی','spoken & written','a flat piece of wood , glass etc with straight sides, which forms part of a door , wall , fence etc',null,null,'یک قطعه تخت از چوب، شیشه و غیره با طرفین مستقیم، که بخشی از یک در، دیوار، نرده و غیره را تشکیل می دهد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a stained glass panel","translation":"یک پانل شیشه ای رنگی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000362395.mp3"},{"sentence":"There were a few panels missing from the fence.","translation":"چند پانل از حصار گم شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001722207.mp3"},{"sentence":"One of the door panels was badly damaged and had to be replaced.","translation":"یکی از پانل های درب به شدت آسیب دیده بود و باید تعویض می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001722208.mp3"},{"sentence":"a skirt made in six panels","translation":"یک دامن ساخته شده در شش پانل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001722209.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
