('ced98660-7079-5dbf-aebf-7f74cc43cc7d','0350cf9c-a64b-5b92-8b47-bd6db2c8a446',1,'for fun','برای تفریح','spoken & written','a social event when a lot of people meet together to enjoy themselves by eating, drinking, dancing etc',null,'hen party , house party , stag party , party animal','مهمانی، جشن؛ حزب (سیاسی)؛ گروه (بازی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a party We’re having a party on Saturday night.','hold a party The party was held at his flat.','throw/give a party (= organize it ) Staff threw a party to celebrate the news.','host a party (= give a large or formal party ) The party was hosted by the Danish ambassador.','go to/come to a party ( also attend a party formal ) Are you going to Tom’s party? About 500 people will attend a party in her honour.','invite somebody to a party I’ve been invited to Greg’s party next weekend.','gatecrash a party (= go to it even though you have not been invited ) Some older boys tried to gatecrash the party.','a party is in full swing (= people at a party are having a good time talking, dancing etc ) At 3 am, the party was still in full swing.','there is a party going on Somewhere near the hotel there was a party going on.','a party breaks up (= it ends and people go home ) The party broke up a little after midnight.','a birthday party They met at her sister’s 18th birthday party.','a Christmas/Halloween etc party I hope you’re going to the office Christmas party.','a big/small party I don’t really like going to big parties.','a dinner party (= one where people are invited to someone’s house for an evening meal ) It’s a favorite topic of conversation at fashionable dinner parties these days.','a cocktail party (= a fairly formal party, at which alcoholic drinks are served ) I first met him at a cocktail party at the American embassy.','a fancy dress party British English , a costume party American English (= one where people wear unusual clothes, for example so they look like someone from a story ) She went to the fancy dress party as Snow White.','an office party I danced with my boss at the office party.','a surprise party Amy has planned a surprise party for his birthday.','a farewell/leaving party You didn’t come to Ken’s farewell party, did you?','a street party (= one held outside in a street ) Thousands flocked to the street party on Princess Street to celebrate New Year.','a lavish party (= one where a lot of money has been spent ) He threw lavish parties for his celebrity friends.','the party spirit (= the way people feel when they are really enjoying a party ) There’ll be plenty of free champagne to get the party spirit going.','be in a party mood (= want to enjoy yourself at a party ) Kate wasn’t really in a party mood, so she stayed home.','party games The children had great fun playing party games.','a party dress The little girls were wearing white party dresses.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’re having a small party this evening to celebrate our wedding anniversary.","translation":"امروز عصر یک مهمانی کوچک داریم تا سالگرد ازدواجمان را جشن بگیریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001171.mp3"},{"sentence":"The university threw a party to welcome them.","translation":"دانشگاه برای استقبال از آنها جشنی برپا کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559167.mp3"},{"sentence":"Are you going to the party tonight?","translation":"امشب به مهمانی می روی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559171.mp3"},{"sentence":"I met John at a party a couple of months ago.","translation":"چند ماه پیش در یک مهمانی با جان آشنا شدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001172.mp3"},{"sentence":"the party spirit (= the way someone feels when they are really enjoying a party )","translation":"روحیه مهمانی (= احساسی که یک نفر وقتی واقعاً از یک مهمانی لذت می برد)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001765024.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('f5400298-9927-5abf-b267-e40eb0a616d0','0350cf9c-a64b-5b92-8b47-bd6db2c8a446',2,'in politics','در سیاست','spoken & written','a political organization with particular beliefs and aims , which you can vote for in elections',null,'party line','یک سازمان سیاسی با عقاید و اهداف خاص که می توانید در انتخابات به آن رای دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I have always voted for the Labour Party.","translation":"من همیشه به حزب کارگر رای داده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001173.mp3"},{"sentence":"He failed to win the party’s nomination for president.","translation":"او نتوانست نامزدی حزب را برای ریاست جمهوری به دست آورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001174.mp3"},{"sentence":"The conference is open to all party members.","translation":"این کنفرانس برای تمامی اعضای حزب آزاد است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001765028.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('cd540855-e7f6-5321-99b1-a2dfb5d96d9c','0350cf9c-a64b-5b92-8b47-bd6db2c8a446',3,'group of people','گروهی از مردم','spoken & written','a group of people who go somewhere together or do a job together',null,'working party','گروهی از افرادی که با هم به جایی می روند یا با هم کاری انجام می دهند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a party of tourists","translation":"مهمانی گردشگران","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559228.mp3"},{"sentence":"There were several students in our party.","translation":"چند دانشجو در مهمانی ما بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559229.mp3"},{"sentence":"A search party was sent out to look for the missing climbers.","translation":"یک گروه جستجو برای جستجوی کوهنوردان گم شده اعزام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000368639.mp3"},{"sentence":"a rescue party","translation":"یک مهمانی نجات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559233.mp3"},{"sentence":"Admission is free for school parties .","translation":"ورود برای مهمانی های مدرسه رایگان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559236.mp3"},{"sentence":"The party has accepted the need for change.","translation":"حزب نیاز به تغییر را پذیرفته است.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"The party have accepted the need for change.","translation":"حزب نیاز به تغییر را پذیرفته است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,7),
('10a87e8d-7e04-5ab2-bb65-2d6ca8897b32','0350cf9c-a64b-5b92-8b47-bd6db2c8a446',4,'in an argument/law','در یک استدلال / قانون','law','one of the people or groups who are involved in a legal argument or agreement',null,'third party 1','یکی از افراد یا گروه هایی که درگیر یک بحث یا توافق قانونی هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"helping the two parties to reach an agreement","translation":"کمک به دو طرف برای رسیدن به توافق","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000368651.mp3"},{"sentence":"He sees himself as the innocent party in this dispute.","translation":"او خود را طرف بی گناه این اختلاف می بیند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001559245.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8c3c8b3e-2cb1-5cc7-98eb-05e98d91cfe8','0350cf9c-a64b-5b92-8b47-bd6db2c8a446',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be (a) party to something','مهمانی، جشن؛ حزب (سیاسی)؛ گروه (بازی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3559a553-e713-5bff-bd3c-b4d85ae09db4','8db353d3-0e4d-5ac8-b145-1cba3dad1d85',1,null,null,'informal','to enjoy yourself with a group of other people by drinking alcohol , eating, dancing etc',null,null,'با نوشیدن مشروبات الکلی، غذا خوردن، رقصیدن و غیره با گروهی از افراد دیگر لذت ببرید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Let’s party!","translation":"بیا جشن بگیریم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000368682.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bb594ee5-9325-5673-8a48-49f9372604d4','c3d377f5-98f1-5866-a8f4-9f7fcf6386a8',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to stop speaking or doing something for a short time before starting again','[ intransitive ]',null,'درنگ کردن، وقفه انداختن (کوتاه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['briefly At the doorway she paused briefly.','momentarily (= for a very short time ) He paused momentarily, then knocked twice more.','dramatically ''They have offered us a lot of money.'' She paused dramatically.','pause (for) a moment He paused for a moment, seemingly overcome by emotion.','pause for breath She had to pause for breath after every two or three steps.','pause for thought ''Of course, '' she replied, without pausing for thought.','pause for effect (= in order to make people eager to hear what you are going to say ) ''Now I know what to do, '' Brown said, pausing for effect.','pause only to do something He paused only to make a few notes, and left.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She paused for a moment.","translation":"او لحظه ای مکث کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000373763.mp3"},{"sentence":"He paused for breath , then continued up the hill.","translation":"برای نفس کشیدن مکث کرد و سپس به سمت تپه ادامه داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000373764.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘No, ’ he replied, without pausing for thought .","translation":"او بدون مکثی برای فکر کردن پاسخ داد: نه.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589513.mp3"},{"sentence":"Joe paused to consider his answer.","translation":"جو مکث کرد تا جوابش را در نظر بگیرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589519.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('e8fab088-890d-5fc6-8555-e52884c36df4','c3d377f5-98f1-5866-a8f4-9f7fcf6386a8',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to push a button on a CD player , DVD player etc in order to make a CD, DVD etc stop playing for a short time','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'فشار دادن یک دکمه روی یک پخش کننده سی دی، پخش کننده دی وی دی و غیره به منظور متوقف کردن پخش سی دی، دی وی دی و غیره برای مدت کوتاهی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['briefly At the doorway she paused briefly.','momentarily (= for a very short time ) He paused momentarily, then knocked twice more.','dramatically ''They have offered us a lot of money.'' She paused dramatically.','pause (for) a moment He paused for a moment, seemingly overcome by emotion.','pause for breath She had to pause for breath after every two or three steps.','pause for thought ''Of course, '' she replied, without pausing for thought.','pause for effect (= in order to make people eager to hear what you are going to say ) ''Now I know what to do, '' Brown said, pausing for effect.','pause only to do something He paused only to make a few notes, and left.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('616ce691-43ad-587b-8252-a7d9d514908e','804dae3d-4515-5d30-9ffc-7c3ebc3631c5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a short time during which someone stops speaking or doing something before starting again',null,null,'زمان کوتاهی که در طی آن شخصی قبل از شروع دوباره صحبت یا انجام کاری را متوقف می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a long pause There was a long pause before anyone spoke.','a brief/short/slight pause "Well, that was a surprise, " he said after a brief pause.','a momentary pause (= very short ) There was a momentary pause during which Mr Hammond glanced at his wife.','an awkward pause After an awkward pause, Ray began to answer my question.','a dramatic pause (= one that has a dramatic effect ) In the dramatic pause before she replied, you could feel the tension in the room.','a pregnant pause (= one that is full of meaning or emotion ) ‘OK. Let’s move on, ’ said the president after a pregnant pause.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There was a pause while Alice changed the tape.","translation":"در حالی که آلیس نوار را عوض می کرد مکثی به وجود آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000374236.mp3"},{"sentence":"After a long pause , she went on.","translation":"بعد از مکثی طولانی ادامه داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001589520.mp3"},{"sentence":"an awkward pause in the conversation","translation":"مکث ناخوشایند در مکالمه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000374239.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('d2851d5e-425d-5477-afd6-55d4bc7066b9','804dae3d-4515-5d30-9ffc-7c3ebc3631c5',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a control which allows you to stop a CD player , DVD player etc for a short time and start it again',null,null,'کنترلی که به شما امکان می دهد یک پخش کننده سی دی، پخش کننده DVD و غیره را برای مدت کوتاهی متوقف کنید و دوباره آن را راه اندازی کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a long pause There was a long pause before anyone spoke.','a brief/short/slight pause "Well, that was a surprise, " he said after a brief pause.','a momentary pause (= very short ) There was a momentary pause during which Mr Hammond glanced at his wife.','an awkward pause After an awkward pause, Ray began to answer my question.','a dramatic pause (= one that has a dramatic effect ) In the dramatic pause before she replied, you could feel the tension in the room.','a pregnant pause (= one that is full of meaning or emotion ) ‘OK. Let’s move on, ’ said the president after a pregnant pause.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('94411699-83ca-5c49-8527-71b469fa809e','804dae3d-4515-5d30-9ffc-7c3ebc3631c5',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a mark ( ) over a musical note, showing that the note is to be played or sung longer than usual',null,null,'یک علامت ( ) روی یک نت موسیقی، که نشان می دهد نت باید بیشتر از حد معمول نواخته شود یا خوانده شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a long pause There was a long pause before anyone spoke.','a brief/short/slight pause "Well, that was a surprise, " he said after a brief pause.','a momentary pause (= very short ) There was a momentary pause during which Mr Hammond glanced at his wife.','an awkward pause After an awkward pause, Ray began to answer my question.','a dramatic pause (= one that has a dramatic effect ) In the dramatic pause before she replied, you could feel the tension in the room.','a pregnant pause (= one that is full of meaning or emotion ) ‘OK. Let’s move on, ’ said the president after a pregnant pause.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('c327d0bd-65a2-583a-9bf7-e6d480662fe5','804dae3d-4515-5d30-9ffc-7c3ebc3631c5',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'give somebody pause (for thought)',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a long pause There was a long pause before anyone spoke.','a brief/short/slight pause "Well, that was a surprise, " he said after a brief pause.','a momentary pause (= very short ) There was a momentary pause during which Mr Hammond glanced at his wife.','an awkward pause After an awkward pause, Ray began to answer my question.','a dramatic pause (= one that has a dramatic effect ) In the dramatic pause before she replied, you could feel the tension in the room.','a pregnant pause (= one that is full of meaning or emotion ) ‘OK. Let’s move on, ’ said the president after a pregnant pause.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('2266c849-2796-52b2-9c25-d9cad1d4e30e','3f1fcde7-211d-532a-adfa-66cd3d63d0ca',1,'no war','بدون جنگ','spoken & written','a situation in which there is no war or fighting','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'صلح، آرامش؛ پیمان صلح؛ آسایش (حالت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['world peace The regime poses a threat to world peace.','a lasting/permanent peace He has the chance to forge a lasting peace with the Palestinians.','an uneasy peace (= when people have agreed to stop fighting, but the situation is not really calm ) An uneasy peace prevails in the region.','a fragile peace (= not likely to last ) The fragile peace between the government and the student protestors broke when military police arrested their leader.','peace talks/negotiations A fourth round of peace talks will begin on Monday.','a peace conference Will the US be sending a delegate to the Middle East peace conference?','a peace treaty/agreement/accord The formal signing of the peace agreement took place in Lisbon on May 31.','a peace settlement/deal It is difficult to see how a peace settlement can be achieved.','a peace plan The leadership rejected the peace plan.','the peace process Britain is still committed to the peace process.','the peace movement (= people who work together to achieve peace, and the things they do ) As a young man, he was involved in the peace movement.','a peace campaigner/protester/activist Several peace campaigners were arrested at the demonstration.','a peace rally (= large public meeting in support of peace ) CND organised a massive peace rally in Trafalgar Square attended by over a million people.','a peace envoy (= a government representative ) The EU is sending a special peace envoy to the area.','a peace mission (= officials who are sent by their government to another country to discuss peace ) India’s prime minister sent a peace mission to the Gulf.','make peace (with somebody) (= agree to stop fighting ) Hardliners criticized the Israeli prime minister for trying to make peace with the Palestinians.','bring peace to a place She was praised for her efforts to bring peace to the region.','restore peace The emperor’s brother was able to restore peace in the troubled areas.','maintain peace They’re trying to maintain peace.','live in peace (with somebody) I hope we can learn to live in peace.','be at peace (with somebody) (= not be involved in a war ) Officially England was at peace with Spain.','peace and security The UN was designed to uphold global peace and security.','peace and stability The people of Congo richly deserve peace and stability.','peace and prosperity We have had eight years of peace and prosperity.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The country is at peace with its neighbours for the first time in years.","translation":"این کشور برای اولین بار پس از سال ها با همسایگان خود در صلح است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942457.mp3"},{"sentence":"By the end of the century, France had made peace with Britain.","translation":"در پایان قرن، فرانسه با بریتانیا صلح کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942461.mp3"},{"sentence":"a city where people of different religions have lived together in peace for centuries","translation":"شهری که در آن مردمان ادیان مختلف قرن ها در کنار هم در صلح و صفا زندگی کرده اند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942469.mp3"},{"sentence":"efforts to bring peace to the region","translation":"تلاش برای برقراری صلح در منطقه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661881.mp3"},{"sentence":"a dangerous situation which threatens world peace","translation":"وضعیت خطرناکی که صلح جهانی را تهدید می کند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942475.mp3"},{"sentence":"a lasting peace between the two sides","translation":"صلح پایدار بین دو طرف","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942480.mp3"},{"sentence":"An uneasy peace continued until 1939.","translation":"صلح ناآرام تا سال 1939 ادامه یافت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942484.mp3"},{"sentence":"the Northern Ireland peace talks","translation":"مذاکرات صلح ایرلند شمالی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942488.mp3"},{"sentence":"an international peace conference","translation":"کنفرانس بین المللی صلح","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942495.mp3"},{"sentence":"the peace treaty that ended the First World War","translation":"پیمان صلحی که به جنگ جهانی اول پایان داد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942491.mp3"},{"sentence":"the Middle East peace process","translation":"روند صلح خاورمیانه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001942498.mp3"}]'::jsonb,11),
('954423bb-5990-52dd-aa35-9a2ee8cbe198','3f1fcde7-211d-532a-adfa-66cd3d63d0ca',2,'no noise/interruptions','بدون سر و صدا / وقفه','spoken & written','a very quiet and pleasant situation in which you are not interrupted','[ uncountable ]',null,'یک موقعیت بسیار آرام و دلپذیر که در آن مزاحم شما نمی شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ll leave you now and let you get dressed in peace.","translation":"من الان شما را ترک می کنم و اجازه می دهم در آرامش لباس بپوشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000378041.mp3"},{"sentence":"I wish she would just leave me in peace .","translation":"کاش او مرا در آرامش رها می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001665730.mp3"},{"sentence":"All I want is some peace and quiet .","translation":"تنها چیزی که می خواهم کمی آرامش و سکوت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000378044.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('f68a4d48-5eaa-5bfb-aceb-7eb62b668925','3f1fcde7-211d-532a-adfa-66cd3d63d0ca',3,'calm/not worried','آرام/نگران نیست','spoken & written','a feeling of being calm , happy , and not worried','[ uncountable ]',null,'احساس آرامش، شادی و عدم نگرانی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the search for inner peace","translation":"جستجوی آرامش درونی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000378050.mp3"},{"sentence":"Having household insurance is supposed to give you peace of mind .","translation":"قرار است داشتن بیمه خانگی به شما آرامش دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001665740.mp3"},{"sentence":"Lynn seems to be more at peace with herself these days (= calm, satisfied, no longer worried about anything ) .","translation":"به نظر می رسد لین این روزها بیشتر با خودش در صلح است (= آرام، راضی، دیگر نگران هیچ چیز نیست).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001665748.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
