('2143ec13-b7c0-5cf9-8030-8c0dbfd443ec','6cee5f85-4427-5be8-9184-9bcb7287dc88',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a food made of thin flat round bread , baked with tomato , cheese , and sometimes vegetables or meat on top',null,null,'پیتزا، پیتزا (خوراکی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a slice of pizza","translation":"یک تکه پیتزا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001538795.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4f582803-db12-5422-9e29-cb384a068465','1bd697d5-543e-5350-8949-4d4b437d5246',1,'area/space/building etc','منطقه / فضا / ساختمان و غیره','spoken & written','a space or area, for example a particular point on a surface or in a room, building, town, city etc',null,null,'مکان، جا؛ جای (خانه)؛ موقعیت (نوشتن)؛ مقام','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a meeting place The club was a meeting place for musicians.','a hiding place He had watched the farm workers from his hiding place.','a resting place (= a place where someone or something stays or is buried ) This tomb is the last resting place of the Davison family.','somebody’s place of birth formal I need to know his date of birth, and his place of birth.','somebody’s place of work/employment formal Please give the address of your place of work.','somebody’s place of residence formal By law, you must inform us if you change your place of residence.','somebody’s/something’s place of origin formal (= the place where someone or something first came from ) I believe my mother''s place of origin was Sierra Leone.','a place of safety His young son had been sent away to a place of safety.','a place of refuge (= somewhere safe to go or hide ) If ever you need a place of refuge, come to us.','a place of worship The church is much more than a place of worship.','a place of pilgrimage (= one that people visit because it is special, usually for a religious reason ) Her grave became a place of pilgrimage.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Make sure you keep the key in a safe place.","translation":"مطمئن شوید که کلید را در مکانی امن نگه دارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000332147.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve spent the day dashing about from place to place.","translation":"من روز را صرف دویدن از جایی به جای دیگر کرده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784340.mp3"},{"sentence":"The place was full of screaming children.","translation":"آنجا پر از بچه هایی بود که جیغ می زدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000332154.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was threatening to burn the place down.","translation":"او تهدید می کرد که محل را به آتش می کشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784341.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had never been back to the place where the accident happened.","translation":"او هرگز به محل حادثه برنگشته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000332146.mp3"},{"sentence":"The theatre bar was our usual meeting place.","translation":"بار تئاتر محل ملاقات همیشگی ما بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784342.mp3"},{"sentence":"We were living then in a place called Alberiga.","translation":"ما در آن زمان در مکانی به نام آلبریگا زندگی می کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000332185.mp3"},{"sentence":"The wall was quite damp in places (= in some places ) .","translation":"دیوار در جاهایی (= در بعضی جاها) کاملاً نمناک بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784343.mp3"},{"sentence":"This is a great place for a holiday.","translation":"این یک مکان عالی برای تعطیلات است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001209.mp3"},{"sentence":"I couldn’t find a place to park.","translation":"جایی برای پارک پیدا نکردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784353.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did the accident happen at your place of work (= the place where you work ) ?","translation":"آیا حادثه در محل کار شما (= محل کار شما) اتفاق افتاده است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001210.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Great Mosque has been a place of worship for Muslims for centuries.","translation":"مسجد جامع قرن ها محل عبادت مسلمانان بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001211.mp3"}]'::jsonb,12),
('34a6fb52-3ea2-5208-b451-9a50e41d21ed','1bd697d5-543e-5350-8949-4d4b437d5246',2,'home','خانه','informal','a house or apartment where someone lives',null,null,'خانه یا آپارتمانی که شخصی در آن زندگی می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a meeting place The club was a meeting place for musicians.','a hiding place He had watched the farm workers from his hiding place.','a resting place (= a place where someone or something stays or is buried ) This tomb is the last resting place of the Davison family.','somebody’s place of birth formal I need to know his date of birth, and his place of birth.','somebody’s place of work/employment formal Please give the address of your place of work.','somebody’s place of residence formal By law, you must inform us if you change your place of residence.','somebody’s/something’s place of origin formal (= the place where someone or something first came from ) I believe my mother''s place of origin was Sierra Leone.','a place of safety His young son had been sent away to a place of safety.','a place of refuge (= somewhere safe to go or hide ) If ever you need a place of refuge, come to us.','a place of worship The church is much more than a place of worship.','a place of pilgrimage (= one that people visit because it is special, usually for a religious reason ) Her grave became a place of pilgrimage.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"They’ve got quite a big place on the outskirts of Leeds.","translation":"آنها مکان بسیار بزرگی در حومه لیدز دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000332184.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you want to come back to my place for coffee?","translation":"میخوای برگردی خونه من واسه قهوه؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000332197.mp3"},{"sentence":"It took us ages to find a place to live .","translation":"زمان زیادی طول کشید تا جایی برای زندگی پیدا کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784365.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s 