('673e354d-2d32-52ab-8cfd-a0b8bb99e10c','2c0aac0d-a616-5da1-8122-cc401427969d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a large area of flat dry land','[ countable ]',null,'مساحت وسیعی از زمین خشک صاف','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the open plain(s) On the open plains of east Africa are zebras, antelopes, and gazelles.','the vast/great plain(s) Beyond lay the vast plains of the Central Valley.','a flat plain Here a group of small hills rises unexpectedly out of the flat plain.','a grassy plain The village is situated on the high grassy plains at the foot of the Sierra.','a fertile plain The rains washed soil down to create fertile plains.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The grassy plain gave way to an extensive swamp.","translation":"دشت علفزار جای خود را به باتلاقی وسیع داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000333834.mp3"},{"sentence":"the vast plains of central China","translation":"دشت های وسیع چین مرکزی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000333835.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('f99cd2f7-b837-52a8-b267-045ad735af1d','2c0aac0d-a616-5da1-8122-cc401427969d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the ordinary stitch in knitting','[ uncountable ]',null,'دوخت معمولی در بافندگی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the open plain(s) On the open plains of east Africa are zebras, antelopes, and gazelles.','the vast/great plain(s) Beyond lay the vast plains of the Central Valley.','a flat plain Here a group of small hills rises unexpectedly out of the flat plain.','a grassy plain The village is situated on the high grassy plains at the foot of the Sierra.','a fertile plain The rains washed soil down to create fertile plains.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('fc21d470-1894-5d60-b9e4-fd06eec06b3f','b8ad5ed3-b844-5e9d-b22e-b106b537f632',1,null,null,'informal','used to emphasize an adjective , usually one referring to a bad quality',null,null,'برای تأکید بر یک صفت استفاده می شود که معمولاً به کیفیت بد اشاره می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s just plain crazy to spend all your pay as soon as you get it.","translation":"واقعاً دیوانه وار است که به محض دریافت تمام حقوق خود را خرج کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001538905.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('6d3eb7a1-9a48-5fb1-b4f9-94f3da75f0ab','0118a6c7-1b0c-5cf5-bc0e-e9c0e920bab7',1,'aircraft','هواپیما','spoken & written','a vehicle that flies in the air and has wings and at least one engine',null,null,'هواپیما، هواپیمای جت؛ سطح (هندسه)؛ اره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['catch/take a plane She caught the first plane back to New York.','get on a plane ( also board a plane ) We got on the plane and found our seats.','a plane takes off (= goes into the air ) The flight attendants served drinks shortly after the plane took off.','a plane lands (= moves safely down onto the ground ) Because of the fog, our plane had to land at Luton.','a plane touches down (= lands safely on the ground ) As soon as the plane touched down on the runway, I felt better.','a plane flies Several planes flew overhead.','a plane taxies (= moves slowly along on the ground ) The plane taxied to a halt.','a plane crashes Their plane crashed shortly after take-off.','a plane crash-lands (= lands in a sudden and dangerous way because of a problem ) Their small plane crash-landed on a busy motorway yesterday.','a plane carries passengers A plane carrying 10 civilians was shot down.','fly/pilot a plane I admire the guys who flew those planes.','land a plane (= bring it safely down onto the ground ) The pilot managed to land the plane safely on the beach.','bring a plane down (= land it ) He ran out of fuel and had to bring the plane down on a road leading to the village.','get off a plane Would he ever see her again after they got off the plane?','shoot down a plane The guerrillas shot down an Israeli fighter plane.','a private plane He flew to Vegas in his private plane.','a cargo plane (= for carrying goods ) cargo planes carrying emergency supplies for victims of the earthquake','a transport plane (= for carrying military equipment and soldiers ) Heavily-laden transport planes can only land if there is a long runway.','a military plane Air Force jets intercepted two military planes that had entered the no-fly zone.','a fighter plane (= a small fast military plane ) fighter planes from the Second World War','a spy plane An unmanned US spy plane had been shot down.','a plane crash Over 200 people died in the plane crash.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It is a big airline with a large fleet of planes.","translation":"این یک شرکت هواپیمایی بزرگ با ناوگان بزرگ هواپیما است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001217.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s much quicker to go by plane .","translation":"رفتن با هواپیما خیلی سریعتر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001538981.mp3"},{"sentence":"She slept on the plane .","translation":"او در هواپیما خوابید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770034.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
