('ccb1d506-415f-5f34-9f42-b7748f9dd9ad','bf1893f2-18ce-53f0-9d6b-349dfe60e87d',1,'idea','ایده','spoken & written','a single fact, idea, or opinion that is part of an argument or discussion','[ countable ]',null,'نکته، جزئی (تأکید)؛ نقطه (ریاضی)؛ رکن (بحث)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a good point I think that’s a very good point.','an interesting point He has made an interesting point.','an important point That’s an important point to bear in mind.','a serious point He’s making a joke but there is a serious point there as well.','a valid point She raised a number of valid points.','a general point I’d like to make one further general point.','a similar point Kevin Phillips made a similar point in his 1993 book, ‘Boiling Point’.','the main point Finally, I will summarise the main points of this chapter.','one final/last point There is one final point I would like to make.','make a point He makes the point that predicting behaviour is not easy.','put/get your point across (= make people understand it ) I think we got our point across.','raise a point (= mention it ) I was going to raise that point.','illustrate/demonstrate a point A simple example will illustrate the point.','prove your/a point (= prove that what you say is right ) He was determined to prove his point.','understand a point I’m sorry, I don’t understand your point.','see/take/get somebody’s point (= understand or agree with it ) OK, I take your point. But it’s not that easy.','have a point (= have made a good point ) Maybe she has a point.','labour the point British English , belabor the point American English (= keep saying something ) I don’t wish to labour the point, but why didn’t you just tell me?','clarify a point (= make it clearer ) Could you clarify a couple of points for me?','point taken (= used to say to someone that you accept what they say ) All right, point taken – I should have asked you first.','the finer points of something (= the small details ) I’m afraid I don’t understand the finer points of the game.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"That’s a very interesting point.","translation":"این نکته بسیار جالبی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000343227.mp3"},{"sentence":"She made some extremely good points.","translation":"او به نکات بسیار خوبی اشاره کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001223.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are three important points we must bear in mind.","translation":"سه نکته مهم وجود دارد که باید در نظر داشته باشیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000343226.mp3"},{"sentence":"This brings me to my next point.","translation":"این مرا به نکته بعدی می رساند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784519.mp3"},{"sentence":"I agree with John’s point about keeping the costs down.","translation":"من با نظر جان در مورد کاهش هزینه ها موافقم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784522.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('87c3f6d6-3386-542c-8b8d-04bd9f55a067','bf1893f2-18ce-53f0-9d6b-349dfe60e87d',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the point','نکته، جزئی (تأکید)؛ نقطه (ریاضی)؛ رکن (بحث)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('23209313-01ea-568b-827f-c6cb25f71e34','bf1893f2-18ce-53f0-9d6b-349dfe60e87d',3,'purpose','هدف','spoken & written','the purpose or aim of something','[ uncountable ]',null,'هدف یا هدف چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I suppose we could save one or two of the trees, but what’s the point ?","translation":"فکر می‌کنم می‌توانیم یک یا دو درخت را نجات دهیم، اما فایده چیست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784607.mp3"},{"sentence":"What’s the point of this meeting anyway?","translation":"اصلاً این جلسه چه فایده ای دارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784613.mp3"},{"sentence":"The whole point of this legislation is to protect children.","translation":"تمام هدف این قانون حمایت از کودکان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784614.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s no point in worrying.","translation":"جای نگرانی نیست","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784617.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re going to lose anyway, so I can’t see the point of playing.","translation":"ما به هر حال می‌بازیم، بنابراین نمی‌توانم هدف بازی را ببینم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784620.mp3"},{"sentence":"I didn’t see the point in moving to London.","translation":"من دلیلی برای رفتن به لندن نمی دیدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784624.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('2b040b31-e0c3-551e-9d61-86d223d2bcb2','bf1893f2-18ce-53f0-9d6b-349dfe60e87d',4,'place','محل','spoken & written','a particular place or position','[ countable ]',null,'یک مکان یا موقعیت خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The accident happened at the point where the A15 joins the M1.","translation":"این حادثه در نقطه اتصال A15 به M1 رخ داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784628.mp3"},{"sentence":"No cars are allowed beyond this point.","translation":"هیچ خودرویی بیش از این نقطه مجاز نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784629.mp3"},{"sentence":"a border crossing point","translation":"یک گذرگاه مرزی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000343274.mp3"},{"sentence":"Cairo is a convenient departure point for tours.","translation":"قاهره نقطه عزیمت مناسبی برای تورها است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784630.mp3"},{"sentence":"Dover is a point of entry into Britain.","translation":"دوور نقطه ورود به بریتانیا است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784634.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('79d42439-42bd-5a62-bb61-be9ce94041c6','bf1893f2-18ce-53f0-9d6b-349dfe60e87d',5,'in time/development','در زمان/توسعه','spoken & written','an exact moment, time, or stage in the development of something','[ countable ]',null,'یک لحظه، زمان یا مرحله دقیق در توسعه چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I had reached a point in my career where I needed to decide which way to go.","translation":"من به نقطه‌ای از حرفه‌ام رسیده بودم که باید تصمیم می‌گرفتم کدام راه را بروم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784638.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had got to the point where she felt that she could not take any more.","translation":"او به جایی رسیده بود که احساس می کرد دیگر نمی تواند تحمل کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784644.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their win over old rivals Manchester United was the high point (= best part ) in their season.","translation":"برد آنها بر رقبای قدیمی منچستریونایتد نقطه اوج (= بهترین بخش) در فصل آنها بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784648.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sales reached a low point in 1996.","translation":"فروش در سال 1996 به پایین ترین حد خود رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784653.mp3"},{"sentence":"We will take last week’s riots as a starting point for our discussion.","translation":"ما شورش های هفته گذشته را به عنوان نقطه شروع بحث خود در نظر خواهیم گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784657.mp3"},{"sentence":"At one point , I thought he was going to burst into tears.","translation":"یک دفعه فکر کردم قرار است اشک بریزد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784661.mp3"},{"sentence":"Maybe at this point we should move onto some of the practical experiments.","translation":"شاید در این مرحله باید به سراغ برخی از آزمایشات عملی برویم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784664.mp3"},{"sentence":"At that point , I was still living at home and had no job.","translation":"در آن زمان من هنوز در خانه زندگی می کردم و شغلی نداشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784668.mp3"},{"sentence":"You will probably sell the car at some point in the future.","translation":"احتمالاً در آینده ای ماشین را می فروشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784671.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is impossible to give a definite answer at this point in time .","translation":"در این مقطع زمانی نمی توان پاسخ قطعی داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784675.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some children are bullied to the point of suicide (= until they reach this stage ) .","translation":"برخی از کودکان تا حد خودکشی مورد آزار و اذیت قرار می گیرند (= تا زمانی که به این مرحله برسند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784679.mp3"}]'::jsonb,11),
('c3803496-c75e-5138-8f2f-db54d3c1eea8','bf1893f2-18ce-53f0-9d6b-349dfe60e87d',6,'quality/feature','کیفیت/ویژگی','spoken & written','a particular quality or feature that something or someone has','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'کیفیت یا ویژگی خاصی که چیزی یا کسی دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Sometimes she had to remind herself of his good points.","translation":"گاهی باید نکات خوب او را به خود یادآوری می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784687.mp3"},{"sentence":"They would spend hours discussing the finer points (= small details about qualities and features ) of various cars.","translation":"آن‌ها ساعت‌ها در مورد نکات ظریف (= جزئیات کوچک در مورد کیفیت و ویژگی‌ها) ماشین‌های مختلف بحث می‌کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784690.mp3"},{"sentence":"The low price is one of its main selling points (= features that will help to sell it ) .","translation":"قیمت پایین یکی از نقاط اصلی فروش آن است (= ویژگی هایی که به فروش آن کمک می کند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784695.mp3"},{"sentence":"Driving was not one of Baxter’s strong points .","translation":"رانندگی یکی از نقاط قوت باکستر نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784700.mp3"},{"sentence":"One of the club’s plus points is that it is central.","translation":"یکی از نکات مثبت باشگاه مرکزی بودن آن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784704.mp3"},{"sentence":"There were some weak points in his argument.","translation":"در استدلال او نقاط ضعفی وجود داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784708.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('b2632d95-0c71-5aac-81f7-f4f93fcde17c','bf1893f2-18ce-53f0-9d6b-349dfe60e87d',7,'games/sport','بازی/ورزش','spoken & written','one of the marks or numbers that shows your score in a game or sport','[ countable ]',null,'یکی از علائم یا اعدادی که امتیاز شما را در یک بازی یا ورزش نشان می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He is three points behind the leader.","translation":"او سه امتیاز از صدرنشین فاصله دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784712.mp3"},{"sentence":"Leeds United are now six points clear at the top of the table.","translation":"لیدز یونایتد اکنون با شش امتیاز اختلاف در صدر جدول است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784713.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had to win this point .","translation":"او باید این امتیاز را کسب می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784714.mp3"},{"sentence":"You get three points for a win and one point for a draw.","translation":"برای برد سه امتیاز و برای تساوی یک امتیاز می گیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784720.mp3"},{"sentence":"You lose a point if you do not complete the puzzle on time.","translation":"اگر پازل را به موقع کامل نکنید، یک امتیاز از دست می دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784726.mp3"},{"sentence":"The fight went the full fifteen rounds, and in the end the American won on points .","translation":"مبارزه در پانزده راند کامل انجام شد و در نهایت آمریکایی برنده امتیاز شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001784732.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
