('0c845687-b6b1-538a-835b-c2c4839fe6a7','1c8e0b3d-f87e-5095-a3b5-7050d4034a05',1,'news','اخبار','spoken & written','people who write reports for newspapers , radio , or television',null,null,'مطبوعات، رسانه (خبر)؛ پرس (ماشین)؛ پرس (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the national press There was very little about the incident in the national press.','the local press Evening classes are advertised in the local press.','the British/American etc press The British press have blamed other countries for North Sea pollution.','the foreign press African countries want the foreign press to report African affairs.','the quality press (= newspapers intended for educated people ) The book received excellent reviews in the quality press.','the tabloid/popular press (= popular newspapers that have a lot of news about famous people etc, rather than serious news ) He regularly appeared in the tabloid press alongside well-known actresses.','the gutter press British English (= newspapers that print shocking stories about people’s private lives ) The gutter press enjoyed printing the sensational story.','a free press (= reporters whose reports are not restricted by the government ) I am glad that we have a free press in this country.','talk/speak to the press He is reluctant to talk to the press.','tell the press something ‘It was a really tough decision, ’ she told the press.','leak something to the press (= give them secret information in an unofficial way ) The confidential report was leaked to the press.','press reports According to press reports, he was suffering from exhaustion.','press coverage (= articles in newspapers ) The event received a lot of press coverage.','a press photographer A group of press photographers was waiting for her outside.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the freedom of the press","translation":"آزادی مطبوعات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000326508.mp3"},{"sentence":"The press has been very nasty about him.","translation":"مطبوعات در مورد او بسیار بد رفتار کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00681.mp3"},{"sentence":"The press does not always report the whole story.","translation":"مطبوعات همیشه کل ماجرا را گزارش نمی کنند.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"The press do not always report the whole story.","translation":"مطبوعات همیشه کل ماجرا را گزارش نمی کنند.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"To judge from the press, the concert was a great success.","translation":"به قضاوت مطبوعات، کنسرت موفقیت بزرگی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000326519.mp3"},{"sentence":"press reports","translation":"گزارش های مطبوعاتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561004.mp3"},{"sentence":"The band has received good press coverage (= the reports written about something in newspapers ) .","translation":"گروه پوشش مطبوعاتی خوبی دریافت کرده است (= گزارش هایی که در مورد چیزی در روزنامه ها نوشته شده است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561006.mp3"},{"sentence":"The story was widely covered in the national press.","translation":"این ماجرا بازتاب گسترده ای در مطبوعات کشور داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001561013.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
