('540be59a-28d2-5292-9f42-e254a245ffa7','06f71d8f-4d95-557f-8275-503d2b803dc5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to decide the price of something that is for sale',null,null,'برای تصمیم گیری در مورد قیمت چیزی که برای فروش است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['highly priced (= expensive ) The clothes shops all seemed to be full of highly priced designer clothes.','reasonably priced (= not too expensive ) The food was good and reasonably priced.','moderately priced (= not expensive ) On the outskirts of many towns, you will find moderately priced motels.','competitively/keenly priced (= not expensive compared with similar things ) Lower costs meant that Japanese exports remained competitively priced.','modestly priced (= cheap ) There are some very modestly priced artificial plants to be had.','attractively priced (= not expensive ) These figurines are attractively priced at £32.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a reasonably priced apartment","translation":"یک آپارتمان با قیمت مناسب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000290737.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tickets are priced at £75 each.","translation":"قیمت هر بلیط ۷۵ پوند است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000290740.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('9e1a89db-c477-5233-acfb-0243277c6bcf','06f71d8f-4d95-557f-8275-503d2b803dc5',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to put the price on goods to show how much they cost',null,null,'قیمت گذاری روی کالاها برای نشان دادن قیمت آنها','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['highly priced (= expensive ) The clothes shops all seemed to be full of highly priced designer clothes.','reasonably priced (= not too expensive ) The food was good and reasonably priced.','moderately priced (= not expensive ) On the outskirts of many towns, you will find moderately priced motels.','competitively/keenly priced (= not expensive compared with similar things ) Lower costs meant that Japanese exports remained competitively priced.','modestly priced (= cheap ) There are some very modestly priced artificial plants to be had.','attractively priced (= not expensive ) These figurines are attractively priced at £32.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('4b981ed3-1c8d-5280-b5da-2b385317d6c9','06f71d8f-4d95-557f-8275-503d2b803dc5',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to compare the prices of things',null,null,'برای مقایسه قیمت اشیا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['highly priced (= expensive ) The clothes shops all seemed to be full of highly priced designer clothes.','reasonably priced (= not too expensive ) The food was good and reasonably priced.','moderately priced (= not expensive ) On the outskirts of many towns, you will find moderately priced motels.','competitively/keenly priced (= not expensive compared with similar things ) Lower costs meant that Japanese exports remained competitively priced.','modestly priced (= cheap ) There are some very modestly priced artificial plants to be had.','attractively priced (= not expensive ) These figurines are attractively priced at £32.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We spent Saturday morning pricing microwaves.","translation":"صبح شنبه را صرف قیمت گذاری مایکروویو کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000290748.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
