('4f03b549-df03-58b1-9de1-1380433224da','bcc24198-0130-5011-a6ed-51209c23df68',1,'feeling of pleasure','احساس لذت','spoken & written','a feeling that you are proud of something that you or someone connected with you has achieved','[ uncountable ]',null,'غرور، افتخار؛ خودپسندی (غرور)؛ غرور (شخصیت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['great pride Caroline is pictured here holding the trophy with great pride.','immense pride (= very great ) He takes immense pride in his grandson.','national pride (= pride in your country ) A flag is a symbol of national pride.','civic pride (= pride in your town or city ) The museum is a vital source of civic pride.','take pride in something (= feel proud of something ) She takes pride in her beautiful gardens.','be bursting with pride (= feel very proud ) I could see that her mother was bursting with pride.','swell with pride (= start to feel very proud ) He would swell with pride as he discussed his department’s achievements.','glow with pride (= look very proud ) ‘I knew he could do it, ’ she said, glowing with pride.','a sense of pride I still feel a sense of pride at having been a member of the regiment.','a source of pride (= a reason to feel proud ) The Chinese Olympic Games were a source of pride to the whole country.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He wore his medals with pride.","translation":"مدال هایش را با افتخار به دست می آورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698470.mp3"},{"sentence":"He takes great pride in his children’s achievements.","translation":"او به دستاوردهای فرزندانش افتخار می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698451.mp3"},{"sentence":"The people have a sense of pride in their community.","translation":"مردم در جامعه خود احساس غرور دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698478.mp3"},{"sentence":"His heart swelled with pride when his daughter came in.","translation":"وقتی دخترش وارد شد قلبش از غرور متورم شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698461.mp3"},{"sentence":"She felt a glow of pride when her name was announced for the prize.","translation":"زمانی که نامش برای جایزه اعلام شد، احساس غرور کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698466.mp3"},{"sentence":"Success in sport is a source of national pride .","translation":"موفقیت در ورزش مایه غرور ملی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698482.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('d3e23751-01e4-5981-b14d-ab366f9ac9c0','bcc24198-0130-5011-a6ed-51209c23df68',2,'respect','احترام گذاشتن','spoken & written','a feeling that you like and respect yourself and that you deserve to be respected by other people','[ uncountable ]',null,'احساسی که دوست دارید و به خودتان احترام می گذارید و اینکه سزاوار احترام دیگران هستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['great pride Caroline is pictured here holding the trophy with great pride.','immense pride (= very great ) He takes immense pride in his grandson.','national pride (= pride in your country ) A flag is a symbol of national pride.','civic pride (= pride in your town or city ) The museum is a vital source of civic pride.','take pride in something (= feel proud of something ) She takes pride in her beautiful gardens.','be bursting with pride (= feel very proud ) I could see that her mother was bursting with pride.','swell with pride (= start to feel very proud ) He would swell with pride as he discussed his department’s achievements.','glow with pride (= look very proud ) ‘I knew he could do it, ’ she said, glowing with pride.','a sense of pride I still feel a sense of pride at having been a member of the regiment.','a source of pride (= a reason to feel proud ) The Chinese Olympic Games were a source of pride to the whole country.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It hurt his pride when his wife left him.","translation":"وقتی همسرش او را ترک کرد، غرور او جریحه دار شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698486.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think that getting a job would give him his pride back .","translation":"من فکر می کنم که پیدا کردن یک شغل غرور او را برمی گرداند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698492.mp3"},{"sentence":"She didn’t try to hide her anger and injured pride .","translation":"او سعی نکرد خشم و غرور آسیب دیده خود را پنهان کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001842996.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s a matter of pride for some men that their wives don’t have to work.","translation":"برای برخی از مردان باعث افتخار است که همسرانشان مجبور به کار نیستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001941759.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('bcf9eeff-0c55-5e9a-b8bd-0310d0ab5a95','bcc24198-0130-5011-a6ed-51209c23df68',3,'too much pride','غرور بیش از حد','spoken & written','a belief that you are better than other people and do not need their help or support','[ uncountable ]',null,'این باور که شما بهتر از دیگران هستید و به کمک یا حمایت آنها نیاز ندارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['great pride Caroline is pictured here holding the trophy with great pride.','immense pride (= very great ) He takes immense pride in his grandson.','national pride (= pride in your country ) A flag is a symbol of national pride.','civic pride (= pride in your town or city ) The museum is a vital source of civic pride.','take pride in something (= feel proud of something ) She takes pride in her beautiful gardens.','be bursting with pride (= feel very proud ) I could see that her mother was bursting with pride.','swell with pride (= start to feel very proud ) He would swell with pride as he discussed his department’s achievements.','glow with pride (= look very proud ) ‘I knew he could do it, ’ she said, glowing with pride.','a sense of pride I still feel a sense of pride at having been a member of the regiment.','a source of pride (= a reason to feel proud ) The Chinese Olympic Games were a source of pride to the whole country.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"His pride wouldn’t allow him to ask for help.","translation":"غرورش اجازه نمی‌داد کمک بخواهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000291135.mp3"},{"sentence":"She ought to swallow her pride (= ignore or forget her feelings of pride ) and call him.","translation":"او باید غرورش را ببلعد (= احساس غرور خود را نادیده بگیرد یا فراموش کند) و او را صدا بزند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001698498.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
