('9b9ad5e5-2533-5e20-a69e-4af7dbf2b345','90958de0-97e5-59da-a7ba-9514097fa0b0',1,null,null,'spoken & written','existing or arranged before something else or before the present situation',null,null,'قبلی، پیش از (وقوع)',array['previous']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['prior knowledge He denied that he had prior knowledge of the robbery.','prior approval/consent/permission A sale of the factory will need the prior approval of shareholders.','prior agreement We will not disclose this information without your prior agreement.','prior experience He had no prior experience of teaching.','a prior engagement formal (= an event that you have already promised to attend ) The prime minister was unable to attend owing to a prior engagement.','by prior arrangement Visitors can tour the burial tombs by prior arrangement.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"You do not need any prior knowledge of the subject.","translation":"شما نیازی به دانش قبلی در مورد موضوع ندارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568820.mp3"},{"sentence":"Changes may not be made without the prior approval of the council.","translation":"تغییرات بدون موافقت قبلی شورا امکان پذیر نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568821.mp3"},{"sentence":"Vegetarian meals are provided by prior agreement.","translation":"وعده های غذایی گیاهی با توافق قبلی ارائه می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568824.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some prior experience with the software is needed.","translation":"کمی تجربه قبلی با نرم افزار مورد نیاز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568825.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
