('38e522c9-0d4c-5a13-87e0-fa7e0a7ee4f9','944a5793-77c4-5d48-9b69-f6a9a8907df6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to describe something which a particular thing cannot harm or pass through, or which protects people against that thing','[ in adjectives ]',null,'برای توصیف چیزی استفاده می شود که یک چیز خاص نمی تواند به آن آسیب برساند یا از آن عبور کند یا از مردم در برابر آن چیز محافظت می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a bulletproof car","translation":"یک ماشین ضد گلوله","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000301835.mp3"},{"sentence":"a waterproof jacket","translation":"یک ژاکت ضد آب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001602153.mp3"},{"sentence":"an ovenproof dish (= that cannot be harmed by heat )","translation":"یک ظرف نسوز (= که در اثر گرما آسیبی به آن وارد نشود)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569160.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('99331fee-d302-5158-a3e2-19d0bda312d7','944a5793-77c4-5d48-9b69-f6a9a8907df6',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to describe something which cannot easily be affected or damaged by someone or something','[ in adjectives ]',null,'برای توصیف چیزی استفاده می شود که نمی تواند به راحتی توسط کسی یا چیزی آسیب ببیند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a childproof container","translation":"ظرف ضد کودک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569165.mp3"},{"sentence":"vandal-proof","translation":"ضد خرابکاری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569166.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a95108e9-3a78-58bc-9f6b-65045753c84d','944a5793-77c4-5d48-9b69-f6a9a8907df6',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to treat or make something so that a particular thing cannot harm it or pass through it, or so that it gives protection against it','[ in verbs ]',null,'معالجه کردن یا ساختن چیزی به گونه ای که چیز خاصی نتواند به آن آسیب برساند یا از آن عبور کند یا در برابر آن محافظت کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"soundproof a room (= so that sound cannot get into or out of it )","translation":"عایق صوتی یک اتاق (= به طوری که صدا به داخل یا خارج از آن نرود)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001569168.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('8e3b8171-f62b-5384-aec4-f62475b07280','6b2b5297-f5ed-5b38-b9d8-a26568ca62c8',1,'pleased','راضی','spoken & written','feeling pleased about something that you have done or something that you own, or about someone or something you are involved with or related to',null,null,'مغرور، افتخار (از کار)؛ خودستا (فرد)؛ مغرور (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['very/really proud Your family must be very proud of you.','justifiably/justly/rightly proud (= with good reason ) He is justifiably proud of what he and his father achieved.','fiercely proud They are fiercely proud of their native land.','immensely/intensely/inordinately proud (= extremely proud ) He said he was immensely proud to have been elected prime minister. She was intensely proud of being Japanese.','the proud owner (of something) ( also the proud possessor of something formal ) She is now the proud owner of a four-bedroomed house.','a proud mother/father/parent Mark is the proud father of a three-week-old baby boy.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Her parents are very proud of her.","translation":"پدر و مادرش به او بسیار افتخار می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001980304.mp3"},{"sentence":"You should be proud of yourself.","translation":"باید به خودت افتخار کنی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592016.mp3"},{"sentence":"His past record is certainly something to be proud of .","translation":"سوابق گذشته او قطعاً جای افتخار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592017.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company is justly proud of its achievements.","translation":"این شرکت انصافاً به دستاوردهای خود افتخار می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001980308.mp3"},{"sentence":"Seven-year-old Ian is proud to have earned his red belt in karate.","translation":"ایان هفت ساله افتخار می کند که کمربند قرمز خود را در کاراته به دست آورده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000305624.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was proud that the magazine had agreed to publish one of her stories.","translation":"او افتخار می کرد که مجله با انتشار یکی از داستان های او موافقت کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592025.mp3"},{"sentence":"Seth was the proud owner of a new sports car.","translation":"ست صاحب افتخار یک ماشین اسپرت جدید بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001592026.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s proud of his son.","translation":"او به پسرش افتخار می کند","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,8),
('8532bdc8-694a-578d-ac95-3e3d3d915aec','6b2b5297-f5ed-5b38-b9d8-a26568ca62c8',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'proudest moment/achievement/possession','مغرور، افتخار (از کار)؛ خودستا (فرد)؛ مغرور (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['very/really proud Your family must be very proud of you.','justifiably/justly/rightly proud (= with good reason ) He is justifiably proud of what he and his father achieved.','fiercely proud They are fiercely proud of their native land.','immensely/intensely/inordinately proud (= extremely proud ) He said he was immensely proud to have been elected prime minister. She was intensely proud of being Japanese.','the proud owner (of something) ( also the proud possessor of something formal ) She is now the proud owner of a four-bedroomed house.','a proud mother/father/parent Mark is the proud father of a three-week-old baby boy.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
