('48583ff1-e25c-5c19-bc1f-a46db94e8f1d','87b54ddb-c04d-53f2-b56d-df59c015f4a8',7,'homosexual','همجنسگرا','taboo','an offensive word for a male homosexual who behaves very like a woman. Do not use this word.',null,null,'یک کلمه توهین آمیز برای یک همجنس مرد که بسیار شبیه یک زن رفتار می کند. از این کلمه استفاده نکنید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['become queen Mary Tudor became queen in 1553.','crown somebody queen (= officially make someone queen ) The next day she was crowned Queen of England.','a queen rules/reigns (= is in charge of a country ) Queen Victoria reigned for over 60 years.','a queen abdicates (= gives up the position of being queen ) The Queen is unlikely to abdicate.','the reign of Queen Elizabeth/Victoria etc (= when Elizabeth etc was queen ) She was born in the reign of Queen Victoria.','Her Majesty the Queen (= used when talking about a queen ) Her Majesty the Queen will be visiting Australia in July.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
