را به باغ خود جذب کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001772654.mp3"},{"sentence":"The plane has a range of 3,600 miles.","translation":"برد این هواپیما 3600 مایل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000474740.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
