('b6a944dd-ee0a-58e7-8371-9f14a45e12f0','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',1,null,null,'spoken & written','surrounding or on all sides of something or someone',null,null,'اطراف یا در هر طرف چیزی یا کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We sat round the table playing cards.","translation":"دور میز نشستیم و ورق بازی کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001379.mp3"},{"sentence":"Gather round! I have an important announcement to make.","translation":"دور جمع شوید! من یک اطلاعیه مهم دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632683.mp3"},{"sentence":"He put his arm gently round her waist.","translation":"دستش را به آرامی دور کمرش گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001380.mp3"},{"sentence":"I kept the key on a chain round my neck.","translation":"کلید را روی یک زنجیر دور گردنم نگه داشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001381.mp3"},{"sentence":"The ballroom’s huge, with windows all the way round .","translation":"سالن رقص بزرگ است، با پنجره‌های دور تا دور.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632684.mp3"},{"sentence":"There was a lovely courtyard with tables all round .","translation":"یه حیاط دوست داشتنی با میزهای دور تا دورش بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632688.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('1e7de369-8765-5a0a-99f2-b39932cf0d3d','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to say that someone or something turns so that they face in the opposite direction',null,null,'می گفت کسی یا چیزی می چرخد ​​به طوری که در جهت مخالف قرار می گیرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"When he turned round I recognised him immediately.","translation":"وقتی چرخید، بلافاصله او را شناختم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000731463.mp3"},{"sentence":"Graham glanced round, startled by the voice behind him.","translation":"گراهام نگاهی به دور خود انداخت و از صدای پشت سرش مبهوت شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632657.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5bbce545-56d8-51b5-9cb4-5349bf970fb7','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',3,null,null,'spoken & written','in or to many places or parts of an area',null,null,'در یا به بسیاری از مکان ها یا قسمت های یک منطقه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Reggie went round making sure all the lights were off.","translation":"رجی دور زد و مطمئن شد که همه چراغ ها خاموش هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632699.mp3"},{"sentence":"Leah showed me round on my first day at the office.","translation":"لیا در اولین روز حضورم در دفتر به من نشان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632704.mp3"},{"sentence":"A guide took us round the palace and gardens.","translation":"یک راهنما ما را به دور کاخ و باغ ها برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001382.mp3"},{"sentence":"He spent a whole year travelling round Europe.","translation":"او یک سال تمام را در سفر به اروپا گذراند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841459.mp3"},{"sentence":"She looked round the room as though leaving it for the last time.","translation":"او به اطراف اتاق نگاه کرد که انگار اتاق را برای آخرین بار ترک می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001383.mp3"},{"sentence":"changes that are affecting the weather all round the world","translation":"تغییراتی که بر آب و هوا در سراسر جهان تأثیر می گذارد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001384.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('90b5ccd7-c3a2-5243-a200-4fcd613f5ca8','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',4,null,null,'spoken & written','moving in a circle',null,null,'حرکت در یک دایره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She watched the clock hands go round.","translation":"او به چرخش عقربه های ساعت نگاه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632712.mp3"},{"sentence":"An aeroplane was circling round far overhead.","translation":"یک هواپیما خیلی دور بالای سرش می چرخید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632713.mp3"},{"sentence":"Until the 16th century people believed that the Sun went round the Earth.","translation":"تا قرن شانزدهم مردم معتقد بودند که خورشید به دور زمین می چرخد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001385.mp3"},{"sentence":"He stared at the washing machine, just watching the clothes go round and round .","translation":"به ماشین لباسشویی خیره شد و فقط به چرخش لباس ها نگاه می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001774605.mp3"},{"sentence":"a shoal of tiny fish swimming round in circles","translation":"دسته ای از ماهی های ریز که به صورت دایره ای شنا می کنند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001386.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('e1800e96-d8d9-5364-894e-9bebed51b5b3','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',5,null,null,'informal','if you go round to someone’s house, you go to their house, usually to visit them',null,null,'اگر به خانه کسی می روید، معمولاً برای دیدن او به خانه او می روید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I might go round to Nigel’s this evening.","translation":"من ممکن است امروز عصر به نایجلز بروم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001774604.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s invited us round for dinner.","translation":"او ما را برای شام دعوت کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001387.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ll be round (= will arrive ) at seven.","translation":"ساعت هفت گرد خواهیم بود (= خواهیم رسید).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001388.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('6952ef50-d487-50b0-b330-b18299ef7ebb','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',6,null,null,'spoken & written','to other people or positions',null,null,'به افراد یا موقعیت های دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A big box of chocolates was handed round.","translation":"جعبه بزرگی از شکلات‌ها را به صورت دور تحویل دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632693.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’d moved his furniture round.","translation":"او اثاثیه اش را جابجا کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841472.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('3f2ab755-b060-5552-9886-cd6dc04ef5ec','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',7,null,null,'spoken & written','on the other side of something, or to the other side of it without going through it or over it',null,null,'در طرف دیگر چیزی یا به طرف دیگر آن بدون عبور از آن یا از روی آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He ran round to open Kate’s door for her.","translation":"او دوید تا در کیت را برای او باز کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632711.mp3"},{"sentence":"There must be another entrance round the back.","translation":"باید ورودی دیگری دور پشت وجود داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001389.mp3"},{"sentence":"I watched the two boys disappear round the corner .","translation":"من دو پسر را در گوشه و کنار ناپدید شدن تماشا کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001390.mp3"},{"sentence":"She came round to his side of the desk.","translation":"او به سمت میز او آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632710.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('6ccca488-02d5-5a13-b81d-d45768f65305','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',8,null,null,'spoken & written','in the area near a particular place',null,null,'در منطقه نزدیک یک مکان خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Much of the countryside round Hinkley Point is given over to agriculture.","translation":"بخش اعظم حومه اطراف هینکلی پوینت به کشاورزی داده شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001391.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you live round here ?","translation":"آیا شما اینجا زندگی می کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001392.mp3"},{"sentence":"He owned all the land round about (= in the surrounding area ) .","translation":"او مالک تمام زمین های اطراف (= در اطراف) بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001393.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('f76cf1e5-a13a-5de9-99c5-c04a7bb9ff93','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',9,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'round about',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('088ba1ab-5fcd-5a9d-be60-ab9b3da6e90d','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',10,null,null,'spoken & written','used to show that someone spends time in a place without doing anything useful',null,null,'برای نشان دادن اینکه کسی وقت خود را در مکانی می گذراند بدون اینکه کار مفیدی انجام دهد استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"People were just standing round and not doing anything to help.","translation":"مردم فقط دور هم ایستاده بودند و هیچ کمکی نمی کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001395.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7f192a1d-99de-538f-8347-a381e0302061','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',11,null,null,'spoken & written','if something is organized round a particular person or thing, it is organized according to their needs, wishes, ideas etc',null,null,'اگر چیزی در اطراف یک شخص یا چیز خاص سازماندهی شود، بر اساس نیازها، خواسته ها، ایده ها و غیره آنها سازماندهی می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Working from home, she could arrange her hours round her children.","translation":"او که از خانه کار می کرد، می توانست ساعات کاری خود را در اطراف فرزندانش ترتیب دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001396.mp3"},{"sentence":"He had built his whole existence round her.","translation":"تمام وجودش را دور او ساخته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001397.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('afbc4f0e-c73b-5cc8-90e6-5e820f185d92','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',12,null,null,'spoken & written','a way round a difficult situation or problem is a way to solve it or avoid it',null,null,'راه دور زدن یک موقعیت یا مشکل، راهی برای حل آن یا اجتناب از آن است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s going to have to buy a car. I can’t see any other way round it.","translation":"او باید یک ماشین بخرد. من راه دیگری را نمی توانم ببینم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841503.mp3"},{"sentence":"strategies to get round (= solve ) the problem","translation":"راهبردهایی برای دور کردن (= حل ) مشکل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841504.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('74a15235-2727-566a-95cb-f4c5c8151119','a39612a3-e2b7-5aa3-b792-0ce615bd8c83',13,null,null,'spoken & written','used to show the length of a line surrounding something',null,null,'برای نشان دادن طول یک خط اطراف چیزی استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The park was about five miles round.","translation":"دور پارک حدود پنج مایل بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632732.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c2a9d429-c5d2-5d67-88c6-cc4b64e09868','258c1a24-e9ef-50ae-a069-12f858728970',1,null,null,'spoken & written','shaped like a circle',null,null,'دایره‌ای، گوفت (شکل)؛ دور (دوره)؛ گرد (پارچه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a big round table","translation":"یک میز گرد بزرگ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000731385.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jamie’s eyes grew round with delight.","translation":"چشمان جیمی از خوشحالی گرد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000731386.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e4e8283d-fc44-54f2-ae95-2da83d896608','258c1a24-e9ef-50ae-a069-12f858728970',2,null,null,'spoken & written','shaped like a ball',null,null,'به شکل توپ','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"small round berries","translation":"انواع توت های گرد کوچک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000731391.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('91b068c9-39e0-594e-a025-274e5f35670c','258c1a24-e9ef-50ae-a069-12f858728970',3,null,null,'spoken & written','fat and curved',null,null,'چاق و منحنی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"round chubby cheeks","translation":"گونه های چاق گرد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000731395.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('8f5cc0e4-0395-59e0-a1a9-665d3bd2884f','258c1a24-e9ef-50ae-a069-12f858728970',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a round number or figure is a whole number, often ending in 0','[ only before noun ]',null,'یک عدد گرد یا شکل یک عدد کامل است که اغلب به 0 ختم می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Let’s make it a round figure: say £50?","translation":"بیایید آن را یک رقم گرد کنیم: می گوییم 50 پوند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000731399.mp3"},{"sentence":"Altogether, in round figures, there are about three thousand students here.","translation":"در مجموع، در ارقام گرد، حدود سه هزار دانش آموز در اینجا وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841581.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('2ef0225f-e6f2-59e5-a64b-df9862424bbd','2f482ee9-952e-575c-a37d-430f23fd4f7e',1,'series','سری','spoken & written','a round of events is a series of related events, which are part of a longer process',null,null,'دور، دوره (مسابقات)؛ گرد (پارچه)؛ مرتبه (گفتگو)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a round of talks/negotiations/meetings A second round of talks got under way this week.','a round of voting In the first round of voting he took 44.5 percent of the vote,','a round of cuts (= when a government or a company reduces the size or amount of something ) The president is likely to approve a new round of cuts in military forces.','a round of layoffs (= when people are told to leave their jobs ) The latest round of layoffs could bring its labor force down to 60,000.','a round of violence What has prompted the latest round of violence?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a third round of peace talks","translation":"دور سوم مذاکرات صلح","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632806.mp3"},{"sentence":"the Government’s latest round of expenditure cuts","translation":"آخرین دور کاهش هزینه های دولت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632812.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('31c02389-e602-539f-bb62-e55714d8ec0d','2f482ee9-952e-575c-a37d-430f23fd4f7e',2,'competition','رقابت','spoken & written','one of the parts of a competition that you have to finish or win before you can go on to the next part',null,null,'یکی از قسمت های مسابقه که باید آن را تمام کنید یا برنده شوید تا بتوانید به قسمت بعدی بروید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a round of talks/negotiations/meetings A second round of talks got under way this week.','a round of voting In the first round of voting he took 44.5 percent of the vote,','a round of cuts (= when a government or a company reduces the size or amount of something ) The president is likely to approve a new round of cuts in military forces.','a round of layoffs (= when people are told to leave their jobs ) The latest round of layoffs could bring its labor force down to 60,000.','a round of violence What has prompted the latest round of violence?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I got beaten in the first round.","translation":"من در راند اول شکست خوردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632820.mp3"},{"sentence":"Two of their candidates made it through to the next round.","translation":"دو تن از نامزدهای آنها به دور بعدی راه یافتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632826.mp3"},{"sentence":"the final round of the championship","translation":"دور پایانی مسابقات قهرمانی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001632834.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
