('ef431bff-1215-574b-bc8a-ff132a7c90de','cf933c2e-9dcb-520d-b50e-865ad1a97061',1,'size/level','اندازه / سطح','spoken & written','the size or level of something, or the amount that something is happening','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'مقیاس، مقیاس (اندازه)؛ ترازو؛ مقیاس (نقشه)؛ محور (پاره)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['on a large scale This technology has been developed on a large scale in the US.','on a massive/huge scale The drug is produced on a massive scale.','on a grand scale (= very large and impressive ) The Romans built on a grand scale.','on a small scale They started by producing and selling on a small scale.','on a human scale (= one that is small enough for people to understand and be happy with ) Architects have been asked to redesign some of the buildings on a more human scale.','on a national scale (= involving the whole country ) The survey was carried out on a national scale.','on an international scale (= involving more than one country ) Preparations to deal with an outbreak of the disease are being made on an international scale.','on a global/world scale (= involving the whole world ) This is a product that can be sold in high volumes on a global scale.','on an unprecedented scale (= more than ever before ) Propaganda techniques were used on an unprecedented scale.','economies of scale (= ways of saving money that are available to large organizations ) Merging these departments will create economies of scale.','the full scale of something He acknowledged that the full scale of the problem was not known.','the sheer scale of something (= used for emphasis ) He was shocked by the sheer scale of the suffering he witnessed.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We had underestimated the scale of the problem.","translation":"ما مقیاس مشکل را دست کم گرفته بودیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000717135.mp3"},{"sentence":"There has been housing development on a massive scale since 1980.","translation":"از سال 1980 توسعه مسکن در مقیاس عظیم وجود داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610286.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most alternative technologies work best on a small scale.","translation":"بیشتر فناوری های جایگزین در مقیاس کوچک بهترین کار را دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610287.mp3"},{"sentence":"A structural survey revealed the full scale of the damage.","translation":"بررسی ساختاری مقیاس کامل خسارت را نشان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610288.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was shocked by the sheer scale (= very big scale ) of the destruction.","translation":"من از مقیاس عظیم (= مقیاس بسیار بزرگ) تخریب شوکه شدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610292.mp3"},{"sentence":"Pollution could cause changes to weather patterns on a global scale.","translation":"آلودگی می تواند باعث تغییراتی در الگوهای آب و هوایی در مقیاس جهانی شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610299.mp3"},{"sentence":"Large firms benefit from economies of scale (= ways of saving money because they are big ) .","translation":"شرکت های بزرگ از صرفه جویی در مقیاس (= راه های پس انداز پول به دلیل بزرگ بودن) سود می برند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610300.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('60878f10-8c3d-5a23-95b2-5b70a5b14686','cf933c2e-9dcb-520d-b50e-865ad1a97061',2,'range','محدوده','spoken & written','a whole range of different types of people or things, from the lowest level to the highest','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'طیف کاملی از انواع مختلف افراد یا چیزها، از پایین ترین سطح تا بالاترین','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Some rural schools have 50 pupils, while at the other end of the scale are city schools with nearly 5,000 pupils.","translation":"برخی از مدارس روستایی 50 دانش آموز دارند، در حالی که در انتهای دیگر مقیاس مدارس شهری با نزدیک به 5000 دانش آموز قرار دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610305.mp3"},{"sentence":"She gradually made her way up the social scale .","translation":"او به تدریج راه خود را در مقیاس اجتماعی افزایش داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610309.mp3"},{"sentence":"animals which are lower down the evolutionary scale (= the range of animals that have developed gradually over a long time )","translation":"حیواناتی که در مقیاس تکاملی پایین‌تر هستند (= دامنه حیواناتی که به تدریج در مدت زمان طولانی رشد کرده‌اند)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000717146.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b533d4de-8676-5ceb-a894-7f8a5d7f0ee3','cf933c2e-9dcb-520d-b50e-865ad1a97061',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'scales','مقیاس، مقیاس (اندازه)؛ ترازو؛ مقیاس (نقشه)؛ محور (پاره)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('24a06691-9f68-5f7a-a74c-aa902fdcb478','cf933c2e-9dcb-520d-b50e-865ad1a97061',4,'measuring system','سیستم اندازه گیری','spoken & written','a system of numbers that is used for measuring the amount, speed, quality etc of something','[ countable ]',null,'سیستمی از اعداد که برای اندازه گیری مقدار، سرعت، کیفیت و غیره چیزی استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The earthquakes measured 7 on the Richter scale.","translation":"شدت این زمین لرزه ها 7 در مقیاس ریشتر بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000717175.mp3"},{"sentence":"changes to the company’s pay scale","translation":"تغییر در مقیاس دستمزد شرکت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000717176.mp3"},{"sentence":"Your performance will be judged on a scale of 1 to 10.","translation":"عملکرد شما در مقیاس 1 تا 10 ارزیابی خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610323.mp3"},{"sentence":"We use a sliding scale (= in which prices are not firmly fixed ) for charges.","translation":"ما از یک مقیاس کشویی (= که در آن قیمت ها کاملاً ثابت نیستند) برای هزینه ها استفاده می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610324.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('f585a813-57f0-5bbf-a1ce-574d628c0061','cf933c2e-9dcb-520d-b50e-865ad1a97061',5,'measuring marks','علائم اندازه گیری','spoken & written','a set of marks with regular spaces between them on a tool that is used for measuring, or on the side of a mathematical drawing','[ countable ]',null,'مجموعه ای از علائم با فاصله های منظم بین آنها بر روی ابزاری که برای اندازه گیری استفاده می شود، یا در کنار یک نقاشی ریاضی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a ruler with a metric scale","translation":"خط کش با مقیاس متریک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000717188.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
