('113db255-b268-56a2-8298-cbf4aad2b901','9ae68cb3-8c6a-54bd-8837-608c1e646e64',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the range of things that a subject , activity, book etc deals with','[ uncountable ]',null,'گستره، قلمرو (موضوع)؛ دامنه (کار)؛ محدوده (فعالیت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['broad The new book has a broader scope.','limited/narrow The scope of the research was quite limited.','widen/broaden the scope of something The police are widening the scope of their investigation.','extend/expand the scope of something They may extend the scope of the project.','narrow/limit the scope of something He had severely limited the scope of his autobiography.','define the scope of something (= say exactly what the scope is ) The group’s first task was to define the scope of the review.','come/fall within the scope of something (= be included in it ) Banks and building societies fall within the scope of the new legislation.','fall outside the scope of something (= not be included in it ) His later exploits in Persia fall outside the scope of this book.','be limited/restricted in scope The law is quite limited in scope.','be national/international/global in scope (= include a whole country, several countries, or the whole world ) Some markets are local while others are national or international in scope.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the need to define the scope of the investigation","translation":"نیاز به تعریف محدوده تحقیق","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001779091.mp3"},{"sentence":"measures to limit the scope of criminals’ activities","translation":"اقداماتی برای محدود کردن دامنه فعالیت مجرمان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001613171.mp3"},{"sentence":"A full discussion of that issue is beyond the scope of this book.","translation":"بحث کامل درباره آن موضوع از حوصله این کتاب خارج است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001779092.mp3"},{"sentence":"Let us extend the scope of the study to examine more factors.","translation":"اجازه دهید دامنه مطالعه را برای بررسی عوامل بیشتر گسترش دهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000720139.mp3"},{"sentence":"The court’s ruling narrowed the scope of the affirmative action program.","translation":"حکم دادگاه دامنه برنامه اقدام مثبت را محدود کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001982763.mp3"},{"sentence":"His efforts were too limited in scope to have much effect.","translation":"دامنه تلاش های او بسیار محدود بود تا تأثیر زیادی داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001613177.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
