('95a28955-e377-5a14-a7b9-75eacd152bbb','5e29e707-103d-5266-a2bd-910de6d0cc4c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the action in a game such as tennis or volleyball when you throw the ball in the air and hit it over the net',null,null,'عمل در بازی هایی مانند تنیس یا والیبال زمانی که توپ را در هوا پرتاب می کنید و آن را روی تور می کوبید.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('94a5a651-cc0c-5aeb-a9dc-f380c8c314a4','379d35ca-f0ef-5789-8823-80d57742971f',1,'move','حرکت کنید','spoken & written','to move suddenly from side to side or up and down, usually with a lot of force, or to make something or someone do this','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'تکان دادن، تکان خوردن؛ لرزاندن (دست)؛ لرزاندن (دست)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['shake slightly Adam opened the envelope, his hand shaking slightly.','shake violently She found him huddled in a corner, shaking violently.','shake uncontrollably His whole body shook uncontrollably.','be shaking badly (= be shaking a lot ) She had been crying, and was still shaking badly.','be visibly shaking (= be shaking in a way that other people can see ) He was visibly shaking with anger.','shake with laughter Both women shook with laughter.','shake with anger/fear etc He stood there shaking with anger.','be shaking all over She was shaking all over, partly from cold, partly from shock.','be shaking like a leaf (= be shaking a lot because you are nervous or frightened ) Diana was shaking like a leaf when she got up to give her talk.','be shaking in your shoes/boots (= be very nervous ) The president must be shaking in his shoes about Tuesday’s vote.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She shook him to wake him up.","translation":"او را تکان داد تا بیدار شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733290.mp3"},{"sentence":"Shake the bottle before you open it.","translation":"قبل از باز کردن بطری آن را تکان دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733291.mp3"},{"sentence":"The whole house started to shake.","translation":"تمام خانه شروع به لرزیدن کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733295.mp3"},{"sentence":"The car shook as it went over a bump.","translation":"وقتی از روی دست انداز عبور کرد، ماشین لرزید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733296.mp3"},{"sentence":"She shook the sand out of her shoes (= removed it by shaking ) .","translation":"شن را از کفشش تکان داد (= با تکان دادن آن را برداشت ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001768550.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('a3977ad1-6157-5ad2-9f70-2e731efc3614','379d35ca-f0ef-5789-8823-80d57742971f',2,'body','بدن','spoken & written','if someone shakes, or part of their body shakes, they make small sudden movements from side to side or up and down, especially because they are very frightened , cold , ill etc','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر فردی تکان بخورد یا قسمتی از بدنش تکان بخورد، حرکات ناگهانی کوچکی از یک طرف به سمت دیگر یا بالا و پایین انجام می دهد، مخصوصاً به این دلیل که بسیار ترسیده، سرد، مریض است.',array['tremble']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['shake slightly Adam opened the envelope, his hand shaking slightly.','shake violently She found him huddled in a corner, shaking violently.','shake uncontrollably His whole body shook uncontrollably.','be shaking badly (= be shaking a lot ) She had been crying, and was still shaking badly.','be visibly shaking (= be shaking in a way that other people can see ) He was visibly shaking with anger.','shake with laughter Both women shook with laughter.','shake with anger/fear etc He stood there shaking with anger.','be shaking all over She was shaking all over, partly from cold, partly from shock.','be shaking like a leaf (= be shaking a lot because you are nervous or frightened ) Diana was shaking like a leaf when she got up to give her talk.','be shaking in your shoes/boots (= be very nervous ) The president must be shaking in his shoes about Tuesday’s vote.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The little boy’s hand was shaking.","translation":"دست پسر کوچولو می لرزید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733297.mp3"},{"sentence":"I could see my neighbor shaking with laughter.","translation":"می‌توانستم همسایه‌ام را ببینم که از خنده می‌لرزد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733300.mp3"},{"sentence":"What’s wrong with you? You’re shaking like a leaf (= shaking a lot because you are very nervous or frightened ) .","translation":"چه بلایی سرت اومده؟ مثل برگ می لرزید (= زیاد می لرزید چون خیلی عصبی یا ترسیده اید).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733301.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was shaking in my shoes – I thought he was going to fire me.","translation":"در کفش‌هایم می‌لرزیدم - فکر کردم می‌خواهد مرا اخراج کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733309.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
