('8c6772c7-7565-582b-8018-ec2745dce9d3','acccbd29-1222-5918-b2d3-6d4f07e811e6',8,'thing not seen clearly','چیزی که به وضوح دیده نمی شود','spoken & written','a thing or person that you cannot see clearly enough to recognize','[ countable ]',null,'یک چیز یا شخصی که نمی توانید به اندازه کافی واضح آن را تشخیص دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A dark shape moved behind them.","translation":"شکل تیره ای پشت سرشان حرکت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000710649.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('14e6c504-34d4-5b4c-a8a8-f827deab0d1d','f69b8318-ca16-5b16-b40e-4ab91452e769',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to influence something such as a belief , opinion etc and make it develop in a particular way',null,null,'تأثیر گذاشتن بر چیزی مانند یک باور، عقیده و غیره و ایجاد آن به روشی خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"People’s political beliefs are shaped by what they see in the papers.","translation":"باورهای سیاسی مردم با آنچه در روزنامه ها می بینند شکل می گیرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000710726.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bd3f1cf6-f841-51fc-b00b-31d912237e3b','f69b8318-ca16-5b16-b40e-4ab91452e769',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to make something have a particular shape, especially by pressing it',null,null,'برای اینکه چیزی شکل خاصی پیدا کند، مخصوصاً با فشار دادن آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Shape the dough into small balls.","translation":"خمیر را به شکل گلوله های کوچک در آورید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769569.mp3"},{"sentence":"an L-shaped living room","translation":"یک اتاق نشیمن L شکل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769572.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7e67a0d5-18d9-540c-88ad-cbdbb6e3e103','2e1e64ce-9712-55d1-b76b-2d5798e450b5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','( Supreme Headquarters Allied Powers Europe ) the place in Belgium where the Supreme Allied Commander Europe , one of the military commanders of NATO , is based',null,null,'( ستاد عالی نیروهای متفقین اروپا ) مکانی در بلژیک که فرمانده عالی متحدین اروپا یکی از فرماندهان نظامی ناتو در آن مستقر است .','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ba4589c8-4d82-52cb-9f17-225dc77c5cf0','a45ecb54-99cc-52b8-ba36-9580a6bd8e42',1,'use together','با هم استفاده کنید','spoken & written','to have or use something with other people','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'تقسیم کردن، مشترک داشتن؛ هم‌قصه شدن؛ اطلاع دادن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We don’t have enough books, so you’ll have to share.","translation":"ما کتاب کافی نداریم، پس باید به اشتراک بگذارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000710831.mp3"},{"sentence":"The three of us shared a taxi.","translation":"هر سه تاکسی مشترک بودیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637063.mp3"},{"sentence":"I have an office that I share with some other teachers.","translation":"من دفتری دارم که با چند معلم دیگر به اشتراک می گذارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769575.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b43fdbaf-1356-5ef4-81c0-f0f3a0aeaae8','a45ecb54-99cc-52b8-ba36-9580a6bd8e42',2,'let somebody use something','بگذار کسی از چیزی استفاده کند','spoken & written','to let someone have or use something that belongs to you','[ transitive ]',null,'به کسی اجازه دهید چیزی که متعلق به شماست داشته باشد یا از آن استفاده کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"As a kid, he’d never share his toys.","translation":"به عنوان یک کودک، او هرگز اسباب بازی های خود را به اشتراک نمی گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000710853.mp3"},{"sentence":"Will you share your fries with me?","translation":"سیب زمینی سرخ کرده را با من تقسیم می کنی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769578.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b1403515-8c37-58d8-b057-7ae4013a76aa','a45ecb54-99cc-52b8-ba36-9580a6bd8e42',3,'divide','تقسیم کنید','spoken & written','to divide something between two or more people','[ transitive ]',null,'تقسیم کردن چیزی بین دو یا چند نفر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They shared the cake between them.","translation":"کیک را بین خود تقسیم کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769581.mp3"},{"sentence":"On his death, his property was shared out between his children.","translation":"با مرگ او، اموالش بین فرزندانش تقسیم شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020227.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('cc6e9947-59d9-51cf-a120-13fe88b2ca88','a45ecb54-99cc-52b8-ba36-9580a6bd8e42',4,'responsibility/blame','مسئولیت/سرزنش','spoken & written','to have equal responsibility for doing something, paying for something etc','[ transitive ]',null,'داشتن مسئولیت برابر برای انجام کاری، پرداخت هزینه برای چیزی و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We share the responsibility for the children.","translation":"ما مسئولیت بچه ها را به اشتراک می گذاریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637070.mp3"},{"sentence":"I own the house, but we share the bills.","translation":"من صاحب خانه هستم، اما قبض ها را با هم تقسیم می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637074.mp3"},{"sentence":"We all share some of the blame for the accident.","translation":"همه ما در بخشی از تقصیرهای این حادثه سهیم هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637075.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('1f520bb5-5283-569c-9dd2-f78fd87f0744','a45ecb54-99cc-52b8-ba36-9580a6bd8e42',5,'same','همان','spoken & written','to have the same opinion , quality, or experience as someone else','[ transitive ]',null,'داشتن نظر، کیفیت یا تجربه مشابه دیگران','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['share a belief/opinion It was clear that the police did not share her opinion.','share a view He shared my view of what had been going on.','share a feeling I know that many people do not share my feelings.','share somebody’s values (= have the same ideas about what is right and wrong ) The only way to change things is to elect politicians who share our values.','share somebody’s concern/enthusiasm etc (= feel the same concern, enthusiasm etc as someone else ) I share the concern of parents about the content of some of these computer games.','be widely shared (= shared by a lot of people ) This view is now widely shared.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Other parents share her belief in the importance of reading.","translation":"سایر والدین اعتقاد او را به اهمیت مطالعه دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637081.mp3"},{"sentence":"I believe my view is widely shared .","translation":"من معتقدم دیدگاه من به طور گسترده ای مشترک است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637082.mp3"},{"sentence":"Stubbornness was a characteristic he shared with his mother.","translation":"لجبازی خصوصیتی بود که او با مادرش داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769588.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('7970a3f5-1f57-5a11-8a7d-e114cb085777','a45ecb54-99cc-52b8-ba36-9580a6bd8e42',6,'tell somebody something','به کسی چیزی بگو','spoken & written','to tell other people about an idea, secret , problem etc','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'برای گفتن یک ایده، راز، مشکل و غیره به دیگران','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Students were able to share their experiences.","translation":"دانش آموزان توانستند تجربیات خود را به اشتراک بگذارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001637092.mp3"},{"sentence":"Would you like to share your feelings with the group?","translation":"آیا می خواهید احساسات خود را با گروه در میان بگذارید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769591.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('17caf38f-3e3d-50f7-91ec-182c95f7a2a3','a45ecb54-99cc-52b8-ba36-9580a6bd8e42',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'share your life with somebody','تقسیم کردن، مشترک داشتن؛ هم‌قصه شدن؛ اطلاع دادن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
