('b477976c-d34f-5be6-8851-321a955ce149','9069b4a5-5e4a-5dbb-b14a-eb260e7994ad',1,'in a company','در یک شرکت','spoken & written','one of the equal parts into which the ownership of a company is divided','[ countable ]','stock 1 ( 2 )','سهم، سهم (مالی)؛ سهم (کار)؛ سهم (بازار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have/hold/own shares A lot of the employees own shares in the company.','buy/invest in shares I bought some shares in British Gas five years ago.','sell shares This isn’t a good time to sell shares.','trade in/deal in shares (= buy and sell shares as a business ) They make their money by trading in stocks and shares.','shares rise/go up (= their value increases ) The company’s shares rose 5.5p to 103p.','shares fall/go down (= their value decreases ) Shares fell sharply on the London Stock Market yesterday.','share price The company’s share price has continued to go down.','share ownership The government tried to encourage wider share ownership.','share dealing (= buying and selling shares as a business ) He was convicted of illegal share dealing.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’ve got shares in Allied Chemicals.","translation":"ما در Allied Chemicals سهام داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001446.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
