('e5ccd3b9-afbc-5f74-9408-fdfda2744d03','3a883423-c7d8-56e7-89af-dfc284969486',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to tell someone that you think they are not behaving sensibly',null,null,'به کسی می گفتی که فکر می کنی او رفتار معقولی ندارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"No, silly, I didn’t mean that.","translation":"نه، احمقانه، منظورم این نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000686130.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('da22bb6b-ba88-5155-b921-80767de0389f','b11e2ceb-8f85-5a52-b685-0410e51122d8',1,null,null,'spoken & written','from a particular time or event in the past until the present , or in that period of time',null,null,'از (زمان گذشته تا حال)؛ چون (دلیل)؛ از (زمان)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’ve been waiting here since two o’clock.","translation":"ما از ساعت دو اینجا منتظریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841586.mp3"},{"sentence":"I haven’t played rugby since I left university.","translation":"از زمانی که دانشگاه را ترک کردم، راگبی بازی نکردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001585304.mp3"},{"sentence":"She left London ten years ago, and I haven’t seen her since.","translation":"او ده سال پیش لندن را ترک کرد و من از آن زمان او را ندیده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841587.mp3"},{"sentence":"The factory has been here since the 1970s.","translation":"این کارخانه از دهه 1970 اینجا بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841588.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was exactly five years since her father had died.","translation":"درست پنج سال از مرگ پدرش می گذشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841589.mp3"},{"sentence":"Since the end of the war, over five thousand prisoners have been released.","translation":"از پایان جنگ، بیش از پنج هزار اسیر آزاد شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841590.mp3"},{"sentence":"He lost his job five years ago, but has since found other work.","translation":"او پنج سال پیش کار خود را از دست داد، اما از آن به بعد کار دیگری پیدا کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841591.mp3"},{"sentence":"I left school in 1995, and since then I’ve lived in London.","translation":"من در سال 1995 مدرسه را ترک کردم و از آن زمان در لندن زندگی می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841592.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ve been friends ever since we were at school together.","translation":"ما از زمانی که با هم در مدرسه بودیم با هم دوست بودیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841599.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s been terrified of the sound of aircraft ever since the crash.","translation":"او از زمان سقوط از صدای هواپیما وحشت داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841600.mp3"},{"sentence":"We came to the UK in 1974 and have lived here ever since.","translation":"ما در سال 1974 به بریتانیا آمدیم و از آن زمان تاکنون در اینجا زندگی می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001841601.mp3"}]'::jsonb,11),
('ff9a99ce-6b73-5b14-a5d4-d51e5cd5ea02','b11e2ceb-8f85-5a52-b685-0410e51122d8',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to give the reason for something',null,null,'برای بیان دلیل چیزی استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Since you are unable to answer, perhaps we should ask someone else.","translation":"از آنجایی که شما قادر به پاسخگویی نیستید، شاید بهتر باشد از شخص دیگری بپرسیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000687123.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('84f0f779-2ca4-5348-ab6b-1ac221319ad7','b11e2ceb-8f85-5a52-b685-0410e51122d8',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'since when?','از (زمان گذشته تا حال)؛ چون (دلیل)؛ از (زمان)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a4fbb781-fef6-5362-beb7-c0b31f04ccdc','b11e2ceb-8f85-5a52-b685-0410e51122d8',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'long since','از (زمان گذشته تا حال)؛ چون (دلیل)؛ از (زمان)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('8cf3d243-ddd1-516d-9b9e-11553856ae0b','34857d0f-2e50-5fb1-a9eb-b2cee48e849d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an ability to do something well, especially because you have learned and practised it',null,null,'مهارت، چیرگی؛ مهارت (فرد)؛ مهارت (فنی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a skill He didn’t have the right skills for the job.','learn a skill ( also acquire a skill formal ) People can acquire new skills while they are unemployed.','develop a skill We will give you the opportunity to develop your skills.','use a skill I am sure you can use your communication skills to get your message across.','require/take skill (= to need skill ) It’s a difficult task, which requires skill and experience.','lack a skill (= not have a skill ) He lacked both the skills and the confidence to take on the job.','hone a skill (= improve it ) The course will help you hone your writing skills.','master a skill (= learn it so that your skill is very good ) Many of these children have not mastered basic academic skills.','great/considerable skill (= a lot of skill ) He played with great skill.','good skills He’s got good management skills.','basic skills The basic skills can be acquired very quickly.','practical skills Students will have the opportunity to learn a lot of practical skills.','technical skills Good technical skills are not enough.','management skills She needs to develop her management skills.','computer/IT skills We’re looking for someone with good IT skills.','reading/writing skills Their reading skills are poor.','communication skills (= the ability to communicate well with people ) The nurse must use her communication skills to help the patient feel at ease.','social skills (= the ability to get on well with people ) Unsociable toddlers were found to have poor social skills later.','people/interpersonal skills (= the ability to deal with people ) He wasn’t a good communicator and had no people skills at all.','language skills (= the ability to use a language ) We need to hire people with useful language skills.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Reading and writing are two different skills.","translation":"خواندن و نوشتن دو مهارت متفاوت هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000692722.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many jobs today require computer skills.","translation":"امروزه بسیاری از مشاغل به مهارت های کامپیوتری نیاز دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605829.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was valued for his skill in raising money for the company.","translation":"او به دلیل مهارتش در جمع آوری پول برای شرکت مورد توجه قرار گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605830.mp3"},{"sentence":"The whole team played with great skill and determination.","translation":"کل تیم با مهارت و اراده بالایی بازی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605831.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('5dfb0e11-18db-50b6-b39b-6f36276a39f7','9b30b997-a2fc-5854-9305-12e7bd530c21',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of outer clothing worn by women and girls , which hangs down from the waist like the bottom part of a dress',null,null,'دامن، ساق (پیراهن)؛ دامن (پوشاک)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She wore a white blouse and a plain black skirt.","translation":"او یک بلوز سفید و یک دامن مشکی ساده پوشیده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000693447.mp3"},{"sentence":"a green velvet skirt","translation":"یک دامن سبز مخملی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605967.mp3"},{"sentence":"a short skirt and high heels","translation":"دامن کوتاه و کفش پاشنه بلند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001605970.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('dc9a6672-e1dd-5316-bb64-f97103f731dc','9b30b997-a2fc-5854-9305-12e7bd530c21',2,null,null,'old-fashioned','the part of a dress or coat that hangs down from the waist','[ plural ]',null,'قسمتی از لباس یا کت که از کمر آویزان می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('c6b87d54-2b50-5c42-98e3-7527cd9799fc','9b30b997-a2fc-5854-9305-12e7bd530c21',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the skirts of a forest/hill/village etc','دامن، ساق (پیراهن)؛ دامن (پوشاک)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
