('86c0765c-5f2d-58e8-baa3-a3a285147ab1','1e3be224-e22d-5a03-af9f-3aa50a29a499',1,'seem','به نظر می رسد','informal','if something or someone sounds good, bad, strange etc, that is how they seem to you when you hear about them or read about them','[ linking verb ]',null,'به نظر رسیدن (از صدا)؛ به‌نظر آمدن (حالت)؛ پس (حس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Istanbul sounds really exciting.","translation":"استانبول واقعا هیجان انگیز به نظر می رسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606504.mp3"},{"sentence":"The whole story sounded very odd.","translation":"کل داستان خیلی عجیب به نظر می رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606505.mp3"},{"sentence":"$80 sounds about right for a decent hotel room.","translation":"80 دلار برای یک اتاق هتل مناسب به نظر می رسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606506.mp3"},{"sentence":"That sounds a good idea.","translation":"این ایده خوبی به نظر می رسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000650720.mp3"},{"sentence":"Nick sounds like a nice guy.","translation":"نیک به نظر پسر خوبی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001835129.mp3"},{"sentence":"It sounds to me as if he needs professional help.","translation":"به نظر من به نظر می رسد که او به کمک حرفه ای نیاز دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000650724.mp3"},{"sentence":"It sounds like you had a good time on your trip.","translation":"به نظر می رسد در سفر به شما خوش گذشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001499.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll come over to Richmond and take you out for dinner. How does that sound (= used to ask someone what they think of your suggestion ) ?","translation":"من به ریچموند می آیم و شما را برای شام بیرون می برم. این صدا چگونه است (= از کسی می پرسیدند که در مورد پیشنهاد شما چه فکر می کند)؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606516.mp3"},{"sentence":"faraway places with strange-sounding names","translation":"مکان های دور با نام های عجیب و غریب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606517.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('1fc03412-e18d-51f4-8b32-a106e58eacde','1e3be224-e22d-5a03-af9f-3aa50a29a499',2,'noise','سر و صدا','informal','if a noise sounds like a particular thing, that is how it seems to you when you hear it','[ linking verb ]',null,'اگر صدایی شبیه یک چیز خاص به نظر می رسد، وقتی آن را می شنوید به نظر شما اینگونه می رسد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"To Thomas, her laugh sounded horribly like a growl.","translation":"از نظر توماس، خنده او به طرز وحشتناکی شبیه غرغر بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001835136.mp3"},{"sentence":"I heard what sounded like fireworks.","translation":"صدایی شبیه آتش بازی شنیدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606539.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her breathing sounded very loud.","translation":"صدای نفس هایش خیلی بلند بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606543.mp3"},{"sentence":"The banging sounded as if it was coming from next door.","translation":"صدای کوبیدن به نظر می رسید که انگار از همسایه می آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001779857.mp3"},{"sentence":"It sounds like the dog wants to be let out.","translation":"به نظر می رسد که سگ می خواهد بیرون بیاید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001779861.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('5193a188-50b0-5930-b7dd-705d86f9ea05','1e3be224-e22d-5a03-af9f-3aa50a29a499',3,'voice','صدا','informal','if someone sounds tired, happy, sad etc, that is how they seem to you when you hear their voice','[ linking verb ]',null,'اگر کسی خسته، خوشحال، غمگین و غیره به نظر می رسد، وقتی صدای او را می شنوید به نظر شما اینگونه است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Are you okay? You sound tired.","translation":"حالت خوبه؟ صدایت خسته است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606520.mp3"},{"sentence":"Josie didn’t sound very keen when I spoke to her.","translation":"جوزی وقتی با او صحبت کردم چندان مشتاق به نظر نمی رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000650733.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her voice sounded very young.","translation":"صدای او بسیار جوان به نظر می رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606521.mp3"},{"sentence":"You sound as if you’ve got a cold.","translation":"انگار سرما خورده ای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000650736.mp3"},{"sentence":"She sounded like she’d been crying.","translation":"او به نظر می رسید که گریه می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001779865.mp3"},{"sentence":"You sound just like my mother (= the things you say, opinions you express etc are just like the things my mother says ) .","translation":"شما دقیقاً شبیه مادر من هستید (= چیزهایی که می گویید، نظراتی که بیان می کنید و غیره درست مانند چیزهایی هستند که مادرم می گوید).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606522.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('eb83c3bc-4e0b-5ee9-8859-062b892c4cf0','1e3be224-e22d-5a03-af9f-3aa50a29a499',4,'warning','هشدار','spoken & written','to publicly give a warning or tell people to be careful','[ transitive ]',null,'علناً هشدار بدهد یا به مردم بگوید مراقب باشند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Several earlier studies had sounded similar warnings .","translation":"چندین مطالعه قبلی هشدارهای مشابهی داده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606549.mp3"},{"sentence":"I would, however, sound a note of caution.","translation":"با این حال، من باید یک نکته احتیاط را به زبان بیاورم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606557.mp3"},{"sentence":"Now it is an American economist who is sounding the alarm .","translation":"اکنون این یک اقتصاددان آمریکایی است که زنگ خطر را به صدا در می آورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606558.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
