('02aa0248-1cfa-50f9-86c5-1c23604470ce','aa6c718d-4aec-5ebb-84ac-499b5f7a0200',12,'sport','ورزش','spoken & written','a race or competition that someone has taken part in','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'مسابقه یا مسابقه ای که شخصی در آن شرکت کرده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a good/great start A 3-0 win is a good start for the team.','a flying start (= a very good start ) The appeal got off to a flying start at the weekend when the group held a raffle.','a promising start (= a good start that makes success seem likely ) Her teacher says she''s made a promising start in learning Spanish.','a bad/poor/disastrous start Things got off to a bad start when two people turned up late.','a rocky/shaky start (= a rather bad start ) After a shaky start, they managed two wins in five matches.','a disappointing start He accepted full responsibility for the club’s disappointing start to the season.','a slow start Work got off to a very slow start because of bad weather.','an auspicious/inauspicious start (= one that makes it seem likely that something will be good or bad ) His second term in office has got off to an extremely inauspicious start.','an early/late start It was long trip so we had planned an early start.','get off to a good/bad etc start On your first day at work, you want to get off to a good start.','make a good/bad/early etc start He made a flying start at college, but then he didn''t manage to keep it up.','have a good/bad etc start We’ve had a disappointing start but we are hoping to improve.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The horse Exotic Wood was unbeaten in five starts.","translation":"اسب Exotic Wood در پنج شروع شکست ناپذیر بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001635804.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jackson played in 353 games, with 314 starts.","translation":"جکسون در 353 بازی با 314 شروع بازی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001635807.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5d067ee5-1a5d-5528-8b8c-af07c3d26cfa','2d1b6400-adcd-5534-99a6-b1a82b09fb12',1,null,null,'spoken & written','( Strategic Arms Reduction Talks ) talks between the US and the former Soviet Union, which aimed to reach agreement about reducing the number of nuclear weapon s that each country kept. Two START Treaties (= official agreements ) were signed, START I (1991) and START II (1993), in which each country promised to destroy several types of nuclear weapons',null,'compare SALT','(مذاکرات کاهش تسلیحات استراتژیک) مذاکرات بین ایالات متحده و اتحاد جماهیر شوروی سابق که هدف آن دستیابی به توافق در مورد کاهش تعداد سلاح‌های هسته‌ای هر کشور بود. دو معاهده استارت (= موافقت نامه های رسمی) امضا شد، START I (1991) و START II (1993) که در آن هر کشور قول داده بود چندین نوع سلاح هسته ای را نابود کند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('8a0fa6d9-dd44-51f0-8fd5-d9c29caac250','e71ad6d4-f9b9-564f-b534-dfb2bcff4754',1,'condition','وضعیت','spoken & written','the physical or mental condition that someone or something is in','[ countable ]','state of emergency','حالت، وضعیت (بدن)؛ حالت (بازار)؛ حالت (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a bad state ( also a poor/sorry state ) The report commented on the poor state of the roads.','a terrible state His apartment was in a terrible state.','a healthy state (= a good state ) Student numbers at the college are in a healthy state.','somebody’s mental/emotional state Whenever Ben stops his medication, his mental state deteriorates.','somebody’s physical state Our emotions can have an effect on our physical state.','something’s natural state There''s a plan to return large areas of farmland to their natural state.','something’s present/current state We can deduce how the planet evolved from its beginnings to its present state.','a constant/permanent/perpetual state of something They lived in a constant state of fear.','an advanced state of something The dead bird was in an advanced state of decay.','somebody’s state of mind What was his state of mind at the time of the attack?','somebody’s state of health The doctor said my general state of health was good.','something’s state of repair/preservation School buildings should be kept in a good state of repair.','a state of shock/confusion/panic etc Howard, still in a state of shock, stared at Newman.','a state of collapse (= the state of being very ill or weak ) The economy was in a state of collapse.','a state of war Syria was still in a state of war with Israel.','the present/current state of knowledge That is the best advice we can offer, given our current state of knowledge about the disease.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are fears for the state of the country’s economy.","translation":"نگرانی هایی برای وضعیت اقتصاد کشور وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652069.mp3"},{"sentence":"When we bought the house, it was in a terrible state.","translation":"وقتی خانه را خریدیم، وضعیت وحشتناکی داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652072.mp3"},{"sentence":"Frankly, I wouldn’t trust his emotional state right now.","translation":"صادقانه بگویم، من در حال حاضر به وضعیت عاطفی او اعتماد ندارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652075.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was in an extremely confused state of mind .","translation":"او در یک وضعیت ذهنی بسیار گیج بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652076.mp3"},{"sentence":"David’s in no fit state to drive.","translation":"دیوید در وضعیت مناسبی برای رانندگی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652080.mp3"},{"sentence":"She can’t go home now. Look at the state of her!","translation":"او اکنون نمی تواند به خانه برود. به وضعیت او نگاه کنید!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652085.mp3"},{"sentence":"The boat was in a good state of repair.","translation":"قایق در وضعیت خوبی از تعمیر بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652092.mp3"},{"sentence":"The country was in a state of war (= officially fighting a war ) .","translation":"کشور در حالت جنگ بود (= رسماً در حال جنگ بود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652093.mp3"},{"sentence":"Water exists in three states: liquid, gaseous, and solid.","translation":"آب در سه حالت مایع، گاز و جامد وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652098.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
