('f58c7105-28d0-51ad-9627-90930e011d60','b479c5d6-baca-511f-b541-4a652511c34a',1,'shop','فروشگاه','spoken & written','a place where goods are sold to the public. In British English, a store is large and sells many different things, but in American English, a store can be large or small, and sell many things or only one type of thing.',null,'chain store , department store , general store','فروشگاه، فروشگاه بزرگ (بریتانیایی)؛ مغازه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"At Christmas the stores stay open late.","translation":"در کریسمس فروشگاه ها تا دیروقت باز می مانند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000617598.mp3"},{"sentence":"She worked in a grocery store before going to college.","translation":"او قبل از رفتن به دانشگاه در یک فروشگاه مواد غذایی کار می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040251.mp3"},{"sentence":"I need to go to the store for some milk.","translation":"باید برم مغازه شیر بخورم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001581344.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
